WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.142 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:42.843 --> 00:00:44.762 line:80%
[♪ surreal music playing]

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:47.222 line:80%
[click echoes]

00:00:48.223 --> 00:00:50.017 line:80%
[whooshing]

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.268 line:80%
[explosion]

00:00:54.188 --> 00:00:55.856 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:00:55.939 --> 00:00:58.192 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Chan, I saw a vapor trail earlier.</i>

00:00:58.275 --> 00:01:01.362 line:80%
<i>But that made me want</i>
<i>to get on a plane to go see you.</i>

00:01:04.782 --> 00:01:05.908 line:80%
<i>Chan.</i>

00:01:05.991 --> 00:01:09.286 line:80%
-[EKG beeping]
-[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:01:11.121 --> 00:01:12.164 line:80%
<i>I love you.</i>

00:01:18.671 --> 00:01:19.797 line:80%
I love you, Chan.

00:01:22.424 --> 00:01:24.677 line:80%
[EKG beeping continuing]

00:01:38.607 --> 00:01:39.650 line:80%
[music fades]

00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:41.944 line:80%
-[dripping]
-[ventilator hisses]

00:01:42.027 --> 00:01:43.779 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:52.121 line:80%
[♪ dramatic music continuing]

00:01:54.081 --> 00:01:56.959 line:20%
EPISODE 2

00:01:57.042 --> 00:02:00.087 line:80%
[doctor] The accident in the US
happened last summer, right?

00:02:00.963 --> 00:02:05.342 line:20%
It has already been three months
since you came to Korea for treatment.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.054 line:20%
Have you recalled any more memories
after our last session?

00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:10.681 line:20%
No.

00:02:12.891 --> 00:02:14.476 line:20%
I just keep

00:02:15.394 --> 00:02:16.895 line:20%
remembering one person.

00:02:18.105 --> 00:02:21.150 line:20%
I keep remembering
how she called my name and woke me.

00:02:21.233 --> 00:02:23.235 line:20%
[♪ dramatic music continuing]

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:27.740 line:20%
<i>But no matter how much I try to remember,</i>

00:02:27.823 --> 00:02:30.492 line:20%
<i>I can't recall who she is</i>
<i>or why I'm remembering her.</i>

00:02:30.576 --> 00:02:31.785 line:20%
[sighs]

00:02:31.869 --> 00:02:36.040 line:20%
[doctor] <i>Do you get images of her</i>
<i>in certain situations?</i>

00:02:36.749 --> 00:02:39.001 line:80%
[Chan] <i>No, she's always just there.</i>

00:02:40.085 --> 00:02:42.629 line:80%
<i>She's buried in my brain,</i>

00:02:44.757 --> 00:02:46.342 line:80%
just like that shrapnel.

00:02:46.925 --> 00:02:49.386 line:80%
[doctor] Could it be someone you met

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.806 line:80%
during that year before the accident,
back when everything's a blur for you?

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:56.268 line:80%
[Chan sighs] I've always been alone.

00:02:57.603 --> 00:03:00.648 line:80%
There can't be anyone
who says they love me.

00:03:00.731 --> 00:03:01.732 line:80%
[grip tightens]

00:03:02.608 --> 00:03:03.609 line:80%
[sighs]

00:03:06.153 --> 00:03:07.946 line:80%
<i>I'm not even sure if she exists,</i>

00:03:08.697 --> 00:03:10.449 line:80%
or if it's an illusion in my head.

00:03:11.075 --> 00:03:12.242 line:80%
<i>Or…</i>

00:03:12.743 --> 00:03:14.244 line:80%
<i>if I'm just crazy.</i>

00:03:15.287 --> 00:03:16.580 line:80%
<i>I wouldn't feel</i>

00:03:17.498 --> 00:03:20.584 line:80%
<i>so frustrated if I at least knew that.</i>

00:03:21.543 --> 00:03:25.381 line:80%
[doctor] <i>What kind of person</i>
<i>does she feel like to you?</i>

00:03:27.716 --> 00:03:29.635 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Someone I have to meet…</i>

00:03:32.971 --> 00:03:35.766 line:80%
[♪ music intensifies]

00:03:38.143 --> 00:03:40.813 line:80%
Sir, I'll just get off here.

00:03:40.896 --> 00:03:42.523 line:80%
[lively chatter]

00:03:44.108 --> 00:03:45.567 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song playing]

00:03:45.651 --> 00:03:48.988 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Someone who brought me back to life</i>

00:03:50.155 --> 00:03:54.827 line:80%
<i>and seems to hold the keys to my life.</i>

00:04:00.165 --> 00:04:03.419 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song continuing]

00:04:22.354 --> 00:04:23.897 line:80%
[panting]

00:04:45.044 --> 00:04:46.253 line:80%
[fireworks whistle, exploding]

00:04:47.129 --> 00:04:48.130 line:80%
[song stops]

00:04:49.548 --> 00:04:50.632 line:80%
[explosion]

00:04:50.716 --> 00:04:52.760 line:80%
[people exclaiming]

00:04:56.096 --> 00:04:57.806 line:80%
[fireworks crackle]

00:04:59.808 --> 00:05:01.226 line:80%
[footstep echoes]

00:05:01.894 --> 00:05:05.105 line:80%
[♪ Baroque music playing, J.S. Bach
"Goldberg Variations, BWV 988: Aria"]

00:05:05.189 --> 00:05:07.274 line:80%
[Haran vocalizing tune]

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:09.943 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Try listening to it.</i>

00:05:10.027 --> 00:05:11.362 line:80%
<i>I saw a vapor trail earlier.</i>

00:05:11.445 --> 00:05:12.446 line:80%
<i>Chan.</i>

00:05:12.529 --> 00:05:14.114 line:80%
[Haran vocalizing tune on speaker phone]

00:05:14.198 --> 00:05:15.866 line:80%
<i>Hold on. Let me start over.</i>

00:05:15.949 --> 00:05:17.451 line:80%
<i>Try listening to it.</i>

00:05:17.534 --> 00:05:18.994 line:80%
<i>Hey, engineering student.</i>

00:05:19.745 --> 00:05:20.746 line:80%
<i>Chan.</i>

00:05:20.829 --> 00:05:21.955 line:80%
<i>Hey, Chan!</i>

00:05:23.874 --> 00:05:25.876 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:05:25.959 --> 00:05:27.878 line:80%
[panting] Hey. Sorry, Haran.

00:05:29.254 --> 00:05:31.006 line:80%
Oh, that song?

00:05:32.049 --> 00:05:33.050 line:80%
Sure. Send it to me.

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:35.010 line:80%
I'll listen to it.

00:05:35.094 --> 00:05:37.179 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:05:37.262 --> 00:05:39.181 line:80%
[fireworks exploding]

00:05:39.264 --> 00:05:40.391 line:20%
[laptop pings]

00:05:41.141 --> 00:05:42.267 line:20%
[laptop pings]

00:05:43.268 --> 00:05:44.895 line:80%
[Hyeokchan sighs] I have to go in a hurry.

00:05:44.979 --> 00:05:47.898 line:80%
Can you message her back
and say I have to go to the lab?

00:05:47.982 --> 00:05:49.984 line:80%
Sorry. Do me a solid.

00:05:51.902 --> 00:05:53.028 line:80%
Tsk.

00:05:53.112 --> 00:05:54.113 line:80%
-[door closes]
-[sighs]

00:05:54.196 --> 00:05:55.572 line:80%
-[laptop pings]
-Tsk.

00:05:57.491 --> 00:05:59.243 line:20%
-[sighs]
-[laptop pings]

00:06:06.667 --> 00:06:08.961 line:80%
[Chan sighs]
<i>Sorry, I'm heading to the lab.</i>

00:06:11.422 --> 00:06:12.756 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I was feeling trapped.</i>

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.843 line:20%
<i>I feel like I'm surrounded by walls today.</i>

00:06:15.926 --> 00:06:19.221 line:80%
<i>I just messaged you</i>
<i>because I wanted to talk to someone.</i>

00:06:19.304 --> 00:06:22.224 line:80%
<i>-But you're busy. Sorry I bothered you.</i>
-[sighs]

00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:24.935 line:80%
"Surrounded by walls"?

00:06:25.602 --> 00:06:27.980 line:80%
I FEEL LIKE I'M SURROUNDED BY WALLS TODAY

00:06:29.648 --> 00:06:30.649 line:80%
[sighs]

00:06:35.362 --> 00:06:37.448 line:80%
[Chan] <i>If it's okay with you,</i>

00:06:38.198 --> 00:06:40.659 line:80%
<i>you can talk to me.</i>

00:06:42.494 --> 00:06:43.787 line:80%
I'll be away for a few weeks.

00:06:44.621 --> 00:06:48.334 line:80%
I'm traveling around the East Coast
during vacation.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:55.841 line:80%
[door closes]

00:06:57.301 --> 00:07:00.554 line:80%
[Chan sighs] Hyeokchan,
you took my laptop.

00:07:00.637 --> 00:07:01.930 line:80%
My research data is in there.

00:07:02.014 --> 00:07:04.224 line:80%
[Hyeokchan]
<i>I must've confused it with mine. Sorry.</i>

00:07:04.308 --> 00:07:05.601 line:80%
<i>I'll send you the data.</i>

00:07:05.684 --> 00:07:07.603 line:80%
<i>-Just use my laptop for now.</i>
-[Chan sighs] I…

00:07:07.686 --> 00:07:08.979 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:09.063 --> 00:07:10.189 line:80%
[laptop pings]

00:07:10.272 --> 00:07:12.900 line:80%
-How do I turn off that sound?
-[Hyeokchan] <i>The messenger alarm?</i>

00:07:12.983 --> 00:07:14.860 line:80%
<i>Just mute it and ignore the messages</i>

00:07:14.943 --> 00:07:17.821 line:80%
<i>or tell her I'm at the lab.</i>

00:07:17.905 --> 00:07:19.698 line:80%
<i>Anyway, send me your email address.</i>

00:07:19.782 --> 00:07:20.783 line:80%
Hey.

00:07:20.866 --> 00:07:22.326 line:80%
[echoing] Kang Hyeokchan!

00:07:22.409 --> 00:07:24.745 line:80%
[fireworks exploding]

00:07:24.828 --> 00:07:27.039 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:07:27.122 --> 00:07:30.709 line:80%
[♪ Baroque music playing, J.S. Bach
"Goldberg Variations, BWV 988: Aria"]

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:35.881 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Chan.</i>

00:07:36.382 --> 00:07:37.383 line:80%
<i>I love you.</i>

00:07:37.466 --> 00:07:38.884 line:20%
<i>I love you,</i>

00:07:39.635 --> 00:07:41.345 line:20%
<i>Kang Hyeokchan. </i>[chuckles]

00:07:41.428 --> 00:07:44.431 line:80%
-[♪ dramatic music playing]
-[breathing heavily]

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.537 line:80%
[footsteps echo]

00:08:10.666 --> 00:08:13.711 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Seonu Chan… who are you?</i>

00:08:14.086 --> 00:08:17.172 line:80%
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:35.941 line:80%
Oh.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.986 line:80%
Gosh, my eyes are so dry. [chuckles]

00:08:39.069 --> 00:08:40.404 line:80%
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:08:40.487 --> 00:08:43.282 line:80%
It's not like I have some big secret.
[chuckles, sniffles]

00:08:43.365 --> 00:08:44.783 line:80%
Dry eyes?

00:08:44.867 --> 00:08:48.829 line:80%
You follow me around, take photos of me,
then send them to my office.

00:08:48.912 --> 00:08:50.581 line:80%
Why are you stalking me?

00:08:51.415 --> 00:08:53.709 line:80%
-Stalking?
-I found an art museum ticket

00:08:53.792 --> 00:08:55.336 line:80%
in your shirt,

00:08:55.419 --> 00:08:57.755 line:80%
stamped with the date I went there.

00:08:57.838 --> 00:09:01.258 line:80%
I did go to the art museum,
but I wasn't following you.

00:09:01.342 --> 00:09:03.177 line:80%
-I just received a ticket.
-[sighs]

00:09:05.054 --> 00:09:07.348 line:80%
You're the one who called my name, right?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.685 line:80%
My name and my face.

00:09:11.769 --> 00:09:13.270 line:80%
You couldn't have known.

00:09:14.647 --> 00:09:16.690 line:80%
I guess you gathered a lot of info
while stalking me.

00:09:17.733 --> 00:09:18.776 line:80%
I…

00:09:18.859 --> 00:09:22.321 line:80%
I think this… will explain it.

00:09:22.404 --> 00:09:23.822 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:09:23.906 --> 00:09:29.328 line:80%
I always check my partners' websites
before working with them. [chuckles]

00:09:29.411 --> 00:09:30.579 line:80%
[sighs]

00:09:31.121 --> 00:09:34.166 line:80%
You saw one photo and recognized me
from so far away? That's--

00:09:34.249 --> 00:09:37.252 line:80%
I saw you up close earlier,
looking at the Sisley painting.

00:09:38.504 --> 00:09:41.340 line:80%
Then why didn't you say so
when we met at our office?

00:09:41.423 --> 00:09:44.093 line:80%
I'm sorry if I upset you
by not telling you about it.

00:09:46.929 --> 00:09:47.930 line:80%
[sighs]

00:09:48.597 --> 00:09:51.642 line:80%
I guess… I misunderstood.

00:09:52.685 --> 00:09:53.686 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:09:54.353 --> 00:09:55.562 line:80%
[mumbles, clears throat]

00:10:07.241 --> 00:10:08.993 line:80%
Then what are you doing at this hotel?

00:10:09.076 --> 00:10:10.327 line:80%
I'm staying here.

00:10:10.411 --> 00:10:13.288 line:80%
My company booked it for me
since it's close to Nana Atelier.

00:10:13.372 --> 00:10:16.500 line:80%
Uh… Here's my card key. [chuckles]

00:10:17.084 --> 00:10:18.252 line:80%
Room 3017.

00:10:20.337 --> 00:10:21.797 line:80%
Then why did you run away--

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.883 line:80%
I wasn't running away.
I was just heading out…

00:10:25.592 --> 00:10:27.970 line:80%
Because I forgot to buy this.

00:10:28.679 --> 00:10:30.889 line:80%
It's my favorite. [chuckles softly]

00:10:30.973 --> 00:10:33.392 line:80%
I didn't even know you were in the lobby.

00:10:33.976 --> 00:10:34.977 line:80%
Yeah.

00:10:36.478 --> 00:10:38.814 line:80%
Once again, I'm sorry.

00:10:39.523 --> 00:10:40.524 line:80%
[mumbles]

00:10:49.033 --> 00:10:50.242 line:80%
[sighs in relief]

00:10:54.496 --> 00:10:55.622 line:80%
"Stalking"?

00:10:56.915 --> 00:10:58.834 line:80%
[sighs] Darn it.

00:10:58.917 --> 00:11:01.170 line:80%
Then who could have sent those photos?

00:11:02.796 --> 00:11:04.048 line:80%
[Chan] Song Haran!

00:11:04.798 --> 00:11:05.799 line:80%
[grunts]

00:11:06.967 --> 00:11:08.594 line:80%
It's the stalker!

00:11:08.677 --> 00:11:10.846 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:11:10.929 --> 00:11:12.598 line:80%
Stalker!

00:11:14.266 --> 00:11:17.311 line:80%
[Hayeong clicks tongue] You darn stalker!

00:11:17.811 --> 00:11:19.521 line:80%
Don't you dare touch my sister!

00:11:19.605 --> 00:11:21.023 line:80%
I'm reporting you!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.234 line:80%
What is he doing here?

00:11:25.486 --> 00:11:27.404 line:80%
[yelps, grunts]

00:11:29.573 --> 00:11:32.117 line:80%
[gasps, sighs] Thank you.

00:11:34.328 --> 00:11:35.329 line:80%
What?

00:11:38.082 --> 00:11:39.958 line:80%
Stalker! Stalker!

00:11:40.751 --> 00:11:42.044 line:80%
I'll get him.

00:11:42.127 --> 00:11:43.128 line:80%
[Haran exclaims]

00:11:43.212 --> 00:11:45.714 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.468 line:80%
[panting]

00:11:49.551 --> 00:11:50.803 line:80%
[Haran breathes heavily]

00:11:58.477 --> 00:11:59.728 line:80%
-[Haran squeals]
-[Chan grunts]

00:12:01.355 --> 00:12:03.524 line:80%
-[Chan panting]
-[gasps]

00:12:04.233 --> 00:12:06.193 line:80%
-Are you okay?
-[gasping]

00:12:06.276 --> 00:12:08.028 line:80%
[footsteps thudding]

00:12:08.779 --> 00:12:10.781 line:80%
[Chan and stalker grunting]

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:14.118 line:80%
[panting] Huh?

00:12:14.201 --> 00:12:15.995 line:80%
[panting]

00:12:16.662 --> 00:12:19.999 line:80%
[police siren wailing]

00:12:22.418 --> 00:12:23.794 line:80%
[keyboard clacking]

00:12:23.877 --> 00:12:26.588 line:80%
[officer bangs on table] Answer me.

00:12:26.672 --> 00:12:28.632 line:80%
What was in that bottle?

00:12:30.342 --> 00:12:31.427 line:80%
You'd better talk.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.345 line:80%
Do you want to film a vlog in prison?

00:12:33.429 --> 00:12:35.306 line:80%
Song Hayeong, be quiet.

00:12:36.598 --> 00:12:37.808 line:80%
From the smell,

00:12:37.891 --> 00:12:40.811 line:80%
it seemed like
a diluted sodium hypochlorite solution.

00:12:44.023 --> 00:12:45.899 line:80%
Ah, I mean, NaClO.

00:12:46.483 --> 00:12:48.610 line:80%
Sodium hypochlorite…

00:12:49.737 --> 00:12:52.990 line:80%
I mean, it seemed similar to chlorine.

00:12:53.073 --> 00:12:54.575 line:80%
[officer] Oh, chlorine?

00:12:54.658 --> 00:12:57.077 line:80%
I guess you majored in that field.

00:12:58.329 --> 00:13:00.205 line:80%
Why were you trying to throw that at her?

00:13:00.289 --> 00:13:01.832 line:80%
I wanted to ruin her.

00:13:01.915 --> 00:13:04.209 line:80%
She was always getting on my nerves.

00:13:05.878 --> 00:13:08.005 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:13:08.922 --> 00:13:10.299 line:80%
Do you know each other?

00:13:10.966 --> 00:13:13.218 line:80%
[Eunchan] <i>The design contest winner is…</i>

00:13:13.302 --> 00:13:15.137 line:80%
-Song Haran!
-[cheering]

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:16.347 line:80%
Thank you!

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.057 line:80%
I'll treat everyone today.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:21.060 line:80%
[stalker] <i>I always wondered why</i>
<i>you were always at the center of attention</i>

00:13:21.143 --> 00:13:22.978 line:80%
<i>and why everyone loved you.</i>

00:13:23.562 --> 00:13:24.647 line:80%
It was because of Kim Nana.

00:13:26.273 --> 00:13:29.693 line:80%
You're lucky
your grandmother's a famous designer.

00:13:29.777 --> 00:13:32.404 line:80%
I quit my job
because I hated the sight of you…

00:13:32.905 --> 00:13:35.866 line:80%
[chuckles] but it's all because
of your grandma.

00:13:36.617 --> 00:13:38.118 line:80%
You made me lose everything.

00:13:38.744 --> 00:13:41.580 line:80%
Weren't you great
at pretending to be the main character

00:13:41.664 --> 00:13:44.750 line:80%
and acting like you were happy
without a concern in the world?

00:13:45.209 --> 00:13:46.210 line:80%
So why…

00:13:46.877 --> 00:13:48.337 line:80%
Why now?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.839 line:80%
-[Hayeong] Are you crazy?
-[officer] What are you doing?

00:13:52.049 --> 00:13:53.050 line:80%
[sighs]

00:13:55.552 --> 00:13:57.054 line:80%
I don't want to press charges.

00:13:57.721 --> 00:13:59.014 line:80%
Just end this here, please.

00:14:00.599 --> 00:14:01.600 line:80%
GEUMWON POLICE STATION

00:14:01.684 --> 00:14:03.769 line:80%
[Hayeong groans] She ruined her own life.

00:14:03.852 --> 00:14:07.481 line:80%
You went through so much
while you were at that company.

00:14:08.983 --> 00:14:11.568 line:80%
But why were you here? And you, Mr. Yeon?

00:14:12.903 --> 00:14:15.322 line:80%
[Hayeong] Oh... Well…

00:14:15.406 --> 00:14:19.660 line:80%
The photos really bothered me,
so I had to do something.

00:14:19.785 --> 00:14:21.036 line:80%
LOCATION TRACKER

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.664 line:80%
-What are you doing?
-There's a smudge on it.

00:14:23.747 --> 00:14:24.873 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:14:24.957 --> 00:14:25.958 line:80%
HARAN

00:14:26.041 --> 00:14:27.876 line:80%
Something could really happen to Haran.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:32.006 line:80%
<i>I didn't dig through</i>
<i>your phone or anything.</i>

00:14:32.089 --> 00:14:34.133 line:80%
I just downloaded a location tracking app.

00:14:34.216 --> 00:14:36.552 line:80%
But I saw you were here
when there was no meeting.

00:14:36.635 --> 00:14:39.221 line:80%
-I got a bad feeling, so I came--
-Are you mad?

00:14:40.431 --> 00:14:41.473 line:80%
Why would you do that?

00:14:42.141 --> 00:14:44.435 line:80%
What if it really was someone dangerous?

00:14:44.518 --> 00:14:45.978 line:80%
If something happened to you…

00:14:46.645 --> 00:14:49.565 line:80%
[chuckles] Come on. I'm fine.

00:14:49.648 --> 00:14:51.400 line:80%
Bad things don't come with a warning.

00:14:51.483 --> 00:14:53.569 line:80%
People can get hurt in an instant.

00:14:53.652 --> 00:14:55.529 line:80%
"What if I'd done something differently?"

00:14:55.612 --> 00:14:58.991 line:80%
You can regret it hundreds,
thousands of times after the fact,

00:14:59.074 --> 00:15:00.326 line:80%
but it won't change a thing.

00:15:00.409 --> 00:15:01.744 line:80%
That's it!

00:15:01.827 --> 00:15:05.372 line:80%
[sighs] Hayeong,
if anything happens to you too…

00:15:05.456 --> 00:15:07.791 line:80%
Haran, look at me.

00:15:08.417 --> 00:15:09.585 line:80%
Look at me.

00:15:10.169 --> 00:15:11.295 line:80%
[breathes shakily]

00:15:12.338 --> 00:15:13.422 line:80%
I'm right here.

00:15:14.173 --> 00:15:15.215 line:80%
I'm okay.

00:15:16.133 --> 00:15:17.259 line:80%
We're all fine.

00:15:17.343 --> 00:15:18.761 line:80%
[panting]

00:15:18.844 --> 00:15:20.262 line:80%
Nothing will happen now.

00:15:22.264 --> 00:15:23.265 line:80%
It's okay.

00:15:25.768 --> 00:15:26.977 line:80%
It's all right.

00:15:29.104 --> 00:15:31.523 line:80%
You must have been startled. I'm sorry.

00:15:31.607 --> 00:15:34.318 line:80%
But why were you running
with my sister earlier?

00:15:35.569 --> 00:15:36.862 line:80%
Oh, well…

00:15:37.738 --> 00:15:40.783 line:80%
My hotel was nearby. [chuckles]

00:15:40.866 --> 00:15:44.078 line:80%
I spotted someone suspicious
following her, by coincidence.

00:15:44.161 --> 00:15:45.371 line:80%
[in English] Wow.

00:15:45.454 --> 00:15:48.791 line:80%
[in Korean] You're her savior.
Thank you so much for helping her...

00:15:50.125 --> 00:15:53.253 line:80%
Thank you. [chuckles, inhales]

00:15:53.337 --> 00:15:55.172 line:80%
Oh? [exclaims]

00:15:55.255 --> 00:15:56.465 line:80%
Your jacket got bleached.

00:15:56.548 --> 00:15:57.883 line:80%
Why did she have to throw…

00:15:57.966 --> 00:15:59.343 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:15:59.426 --> 00:16:01.136 line:80%
I troubled you with a personal issue.

00:16:01.637 --> 00:16:03.722 line:80%
And I'm sorry about earlier too.

00:16:03.806 --> 00:16:06.350 line:80%
[stutters] It's fine.

00:16:06.433 --> 00:16:07.935 line:80%
Then I'll head back now.

00:16:09.269 --> 00:16:11.230 line:80%
-[Hayeong stutters] Bye, then.
-[Chan] Bye.

00:16:12.314 --> 00:16:14.358 line:80%
What did you mean by
"sorry about earlier"?

00:16:14.441 --> 00:16:16.485 line:80%
I grilled him, [sighs]

00:16:16.568 --> 00:16:18.237 line:80%
thinking he was the stalker.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.990 line:80%
Geez. Ungrateful much?

00:16:21.073 --> 00:16:23.534 line:80%
He even ruined his jacket
trying to help you.

00:16:24.034 --> 00:16:25.202 line:80%
[officer] Huh?

00:16:25.285 --> 00:16:27.746 line:80%
Did the other guy leave?
He probably needs treatment.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.374 line:80%
Hmm? Treatment? He just left.

00:16:31.375 --> 00:16:33.419 line:80%
Hayeong, go home first.

00:16:33.502 --> 00:16:35.462 line:80%
No, take me with you.

00:16:35.546 --> 00:16:37.047 line:80%
I can't let you go alone.

00:16:37.131 --> 00:16:38.382 line:80%
I'm really fine.

00:16:38.465 --> 00:16:40.217 line:80%
And keep this a secret, okay?

00:16:41.093 --> 00:16:42.720 line:80%
Don't report this to Grandma.

00:16:45.597 --> 00:16:46.807 line:80%
Hurry home, okay?

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.600 line:80%
And keep your phone on.

00:16:50.394 --> 00:16:52.062 line:80%
[sighs, groans]

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:53.731 line:80%
My heart…

00:16:55.107 --> 00:16:57.526 line:80%
[sighs] I thought something might happen.

00:16:57.609 --> 00:16:58.861 line:80%
Are you all right?

00:16:58.944 --> 00:16:59.945 line:80%
Gosh.

00:17:00.487 --> 00:17:02.614 line:80%
Of course. I'm fine.

00:17:02.698 --> 00:17:04.450 line:80%
I'm always fine.

00:17:05.451 --> 00:17:08.078 line:80%
Did you need something
approved by Grandma?

00:17:08.162 --> 00:17:09.705 line:80%
Let's go. It's late.

00:17:10.664 --> 00:17:11.665 line:80%
It's that way.

00:17:13.459 --> 00:17:14.835 line:80%
Come on.

00:17:21.884 --> 00:17:22.885 line:80%
Excuse me.

00:17:23.469 --> 00:17:24.678 line:80%
Excuse me!

00:17:25.846 --> 00:17:26.930 line:80%
No, not that way…

00:17:27.014 --> 00:17:28.349 line:80%
Excuse me!

00:17:30.559 --> 00:17:31.727 line:80%
Mr. Seonu.

00:17:33.062 --> 00:17:34.063 line:80%
[Chan] Oh…

00:17:35.147 --> 00:17:37.358 line:80%
[sighs] You hurt your hand earlier,
didn't you?

00:17:38.484 --> 00:17:40.944 line:80%
I'm sorry I got you mixed up in this.

00:17:42.279 --> 00:17:44.573 line:80%
Charge me for the hospital fees,
your jacket,

00:17:44.657 --> 00:17:46.950 line:80%
and any inconveniences
caused by your injury--

00:17:47.034 --> 00:17:48.118 line:80%
Are you a lawyer?

00:17:49.244 --> 00:17:51.205 line:80%
I thought you were a designer.

00:17:51.288 --> 00:17:52.498 line:80%
What?

00:17:53.332 --> 00:17:54.875 line:80%
[♪ soft pleasant music playing]

00:17:54.958 --> 00:17:56.919 line:80%
As you can see, I'm fine.

00:17:57.002 --> 00:17:58.796 line:80%
So you don't have
to draw a line like that.

00:17:58.879 --> 00:18:00.839 line:80%
I don't feel okay with it.

00:18:00.923 --> 00:18:02.675 line:80%
I hate causing trouble for others.

00:18:11.767 --> 00:18:13.268 line:80%
I'm really sorry about today.

00:18:13.352 --> 00:18:15.312 line:80%
Make sure to get your hand treated.

00:18:26.198 --> 00:18:27.199 line:80%
[Chan sighs]

00:18:28.951 --> 00:18:30.411 line:80%
Why does this keep happening?

00:18:32.496 --> 00:18:33.747 line:80%
It's scaring me.

00:18:37.876 --> 00:18:40.504 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[bird chirping]

00:18:40.587 --> 00:18:42.715 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:18:49.263 --> 00:18:51.724 line:80%
[Yoon] <i>She rejected me firmly.</i>

00:18:51.807 --> 00:18:53.309 line:80%
I want to live like this.

00:18:53.392 --> 00:18:54.685 line:80%
I feel comfortable this way.

00:18:54.768 --> 00:18:57.771 line:80%
I know I'm being stupid and weird.

00:18:59.231 --> 00:19:00.316 line:80%
But…

00:19:01.734 --> 00:19:02.943 line:80%
I'm too scared.

00:19:04.153 --> 00:19:05.863 line:80%
-[door opens, closes]
-[sighs]

00:19:08.574 --> 00:19:09.742 line:80%
[door closes]

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.041 line:80%
[exclaims] She's here.

00:19:17.124 --> 00:19:19.585 line:80%
Don't do this anymore, Grandma.

00:19:20.169 --> 00:19:21.462 line:80%
I'll handle things myself.

00:19:22.796 --> 00:19:24.256 line:80%
Pushing everyone away

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.842 line:80%
and wasting time outside,
then hiding in a cave…

00:19:26.925 --> 00:19:28.677 line:80%
Is that how you handle things?

00:19:28.761 --> 00:19:30.137 line:80%
She…

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.014 line:80%
She was with a guy.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.391 line:80%
-What?
-I was with them.

00:19:34.475 --> 00:19:38.103 line:80%
I came home early,
and she spent more time with him alone.

00:19:38.187 --> 00:19:40.064 line:80%
-Don't lie to me.
-I mean it.

00:19:40.147 --> 00:19:41.565 line:80%
Mom, Dad. You saw it, right?

00:19:41.649 --> 00:19:42.775 line:80%
I'm not lying, right?

00:19:43.359 --> 00:19:44.360 line:80%
Is it true?

00:19:45.069 --> 00:19:46.612 line:80%
I'll head upstairs first.

00:19:51.033 --> 00:19:53.744 line:80%
Tell me. Who is he?
And what's their relationship?

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.497 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.665 line:80%
Uh…

00:19:58.248 --> 00:19:59.667 line:80%
Well…

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.460 line:80%
-They're just talking.
-"Talking"?

00:20:03.003 --> 00:20:06.548 line:80%
Just leave her be.
Meddling will only ruin it.

00:20:07.633 --> 00:20:09.134 line:80%
Then good night.

00:20:10.552 --> 00:20:11.553 line:80%
Sleep tight.

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:16.308 line:80%
"Talking"?

00:20:18.644 --> 00:20:19.937 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[door opens]

00:20:21.313 --> 00:20:23.315 line:80%
Gosh, Song Hayeong.

00:20:23.399 --> 00:20:25.859 line:80%
You've helped your sister again.

00:20:26.735 --> 00:20:28.278 line:80%
This household is ruined without me.

00:20:28.362 --> 00:20:30.114 line:80%
You're lucky to have such a great sister.

00:20:30.698 --> 00:20:32.199 line:80%
You made her get the wrong idea.

00:20:32.282 --> 00:20:35.160 line:80%
What? It's true that you were with a guy.

00:20:35.244 --> 00:20:37.454 line:80%
Won't it be good for her
to get the wrong idea?

00:20:39.248 --> 00:20:41.000 line:80%
Just pretend you're seeing someone.

00:20:41.083 --> 00:20:42.918 line:80%
That will save you from a lot of nagging.

00:20:43.711 --> 00:20:46.130 line:80%
No, there's no need to thank me.

00:20:46.714 --> 00:20:49.299 line:80%
[inhales sharply] I'll take this instead.

00:20:50.676 --> 00:20:52.636 line:80%
How is the animator's hand?

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.805 line:80%
I gave him my business card
so he can charge me.

00:20:54.888 --> 00:20:57.224 line:80%
Business card? [sighs frustratingly]

00:20:57.308 --> 00:20:58.934 line:80%
Did I raise you like that?

00:20:59.018 --> 00:21:02.104 line:80%
If it weren't for him,
you would've gotten that chlorine…

00:21:02.187 --> 00:21:03.314 line:80%
[in English] Oh God.

00:21:03.397 --> 00:21:05.190 line:80%
[in Korean] Listen, Haran.

00:21:05.274 --> 00:21:08.485 line:80%
You should at least buy him dinner
and thank him in person…

00:21:08.569 --> 00:21:10.404 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:21:10.487 --> 00:21:13.115 line:80%
But of course… [smacks lips]

00:21:13.824 --> 00:21:16.243 line:80%
you're not the type to do that.

00:21:17.119 --> 00:21:19.955 line:80%
Ah. Give him some new clothes.

00:21:20.039 --> 00:21:21.123 line:80%
His jacket was ruined.

00:21:21.206 --> 00:21:23.000 line:80%
Right. Clothes.

00:21:23.083 --> 00:21:24.710 line:80%
Then next week at our meeting--

00:21:24.793 --> 00:21:25.961 line:80%
Next week?

00:21:26.045 --> 00:21:29.590 line:80%
He's here on a business trip.
He won't have many clothes.

00:21:30.174 --> 00:21:31.258 line:80%
Would that be too late?

00:21:32.301 --> 00:21:33.927 line:80%
-Then a delivery…
-Delivery?

00:21:34.011 --> 00:21:37.389 line:80%
You should at least say,
"I'm sorry, your jacket's ruined."

00:21:37.473 --> 00:21:40.309 line:80%
"I'm not sure if you'll like them,
but I got you some clothes."

00:21:40.392 --> 00:21:45.814 line:80%
Shouldn't you at least give them to him
in person and show some sincerity?

00:21:47.107 --> 00:21:50.194 line:80%
[sighs wearily] I'm tired.
I'm going to bed.

00:21:51.403 --> 00:21:52.780 line:80%
[Haran] Hayeong.

00:21:53.405 --> 00:21:54.990 line:80%
Thank you for today.

00:21:55.574 --> 00:21:59.620 line:80%
[scoffs] You were telling me
to shut up earlier.

00:22:00.746 --> 00:22:01.747 line:80%
Good night.

00:22:03.874 --> 00:22:05.501 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Bad things don't come</i>
<i>with a warning.</i>

00:22:05.584 --> 00:22:07.503 line:80%
<i>People can get hurt in an instant.</i>

00:22:07.586 --> 00:22:09.672 line:80%
<i>If something happened to you…</i>

00:22:12.508 --> 00:22:13.509 line:80%
What's this?

00:22:14.093 --> 00:22:16.053 line:80%
Why are all our shoes in the bathtub?

00:22:16.679 --> 00:22:19.139 line:80%
What do you mean? What shoes…

00:22:20.891 --> 00:22:23.143 line:80%
I'm going to wash them.
They were pretty dirty.

00:22:23.227 --> 00:22:26.313 line:80%
I have an exam in an hour.
What am I supposed to do?

00:22:26.397 --> 00:22:28.440 line:80%
What is it? Are our shoes gone?

00:22:28.524 --> 00:22:29.900 line:80%
How do I go to school today?

00:22:29.984 --> 00:22:32.194 line:80%
I have an important meeting.

00:22:32.277 --> 00:22:34.279 line:80%
You can all stay home today.

00:22:34.363 --> 00:22:36.573 line:80%
-No, I have to go.
-Don't go!

00:22:37.157 --> 00:22:38.784 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:22:38.867 --> 00:22:40.869 line:80%
Just don't go. [breathing heavily]

00:22:40.953 --> 00:22:43.372 line:80%
What if something happens to you outside?

00:22:44.039 --> 00:22:45.582 line:80%
It happened to Mom and Dad.

00:22:45.666 --> 00:22:48.711 line:80%
So don't go, okay? Don't go!

00:22:49.294 --> 00:22:50.504 line:80%
Haran…

00:22:50.587 --> 00:22:53.215 line:80%
-Don't go.
-[Nana] It's okay. It's okay.

00:22:53.298 --> 00:22:54.425 line:80%
Haran, it's all right.

00:22:54.508 --> 00:22:55.926 line:80%
Just stay home.

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:58.595 line:80%
<i>Don't go. Don't go. Please. Please.</i>

00:22:58.679 --> 00:23:00.639 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music continuing]

00:23:03.475 --> 00:23:04.476 line:80%
What?

00:23:05.352 --> 00:23:06.353 line:80%
What?

00:23:06.437 --> 00:23:08.314 line:80%
You just looked ugly. Good night.

00:23:09.565 --> 00:23:10.566 line:80%
[door closes]

00:23:11.442 --> 00:23:12.943 line:80%
[sighs, scoffs]

00:23:15.404 --> 00:23:16.405 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:23:17.072 --> 00:23:18.240 line:80%
Meet him in person?

00:23:19.199 --> 00:23:20.743 line:80%
[doorbell rings]

00:23:20.826 --> 00:23:22.077 line:80%
[Chan] Yes?

00:23:22.578 --> 00:23:23.662 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:23:24.455 --> 00:23:25.497 line:80%
What brings you here?

00:23:25.581 --> 00:23:28.625 line:80%
Someone dropped this off for you
at the front desk.

00:23:28.709 --> 00:23:30.836 line:80%
-Who?
-A young lady.

00:23:31.837 --> 00:23:34.131 line:80%
She asked me to give this to you and left.

00:23:35.007 --> 00:23:37.009 line:80%
[humming]

00:23:37.885 --> 00:23:38.886 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:23:40.346 --> 00:23:41.639 line:80%
How did she know my room number?

00:23:43.098 --> 00:23:45.726 line:80%
Ah. My card key.

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:48.395 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I'm sorry your jacket's ruined.</i>

00:23:48.479 --> 00:23:51.231 line:20%
<i>I'm not sure if you'll like them,</i>
<i>but I got you some clothes.</i>

00:23:51.315 --> 00:23:53.817 line:80%
-[thunderclap]
-[rain pattering]

00:23:54.526 --> 00:23:55.527 line:80%
Huh?

00:23:58.781 --> 00:23:59.990 line:80%
[exclaims] No.

00:24:00.074 --> 00:24:01.408 line:80%
No.

00:24:01.492 --> 00:24:02.534 line:80%
Don't get involved.

00:24:04.912 --> 00:24:07.748 line:80%
Please, please, please don't be here.

00:24:15.172 --> 00:24:17.174 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:24:18.509 --> 00:24:20.386 line:80%
[rain pattering]

00:24:22.221 --> 00:24:24.515 line:80%
[Haran] <i>You know that particular smell</i>
<i>before it rains?</i>

00:24:25.849 --> 00:24:27.601 line:80%
<i>I love that smell.</i>

00:24:28.394 --> 00:24:31.730 line:80%
<i>But it disappears so quickly,</i>
<i>so I just stand there smelling it.</i>

00:24:32.898 --> 00:24:36.360 line:80%
<i>But the catch is that</i>
<i>you always end up with a nasty cold.</i>

00:25:03.637 --> 00:25:04.847 line:80%
[Chan] <i>From the smell,</i>

00:25:04.930 --> 00:25:07.641 line:80%
<i>it seemed like</i>
<i>a diluted sodium hypochlorite solution.</i>

00:25:07.725 --> 00:25:09.435 line:80%
Ah, I mean, NaClO.

00:25:09.518 --> 00:25:12.688 line:80%
[Haran] <i>There's another guy</i>
<i>who speaks like him.</i>

00:25:13.063 --> 00:25:14.231 line:80%
[inaudible]

00:25:18.152 --> 00:25:19.194 line:80%
Ah…

00:25:19.278 --> 00:25:20.904 line:80%
You'll catch a cold.

00:25:20.988 --> 00:25:23.365 line:80%
You came here because of me, so take this.

00:25:24.241 --> 00:25:28.120 line:80%
[♪ Baroque music on earphones, J.S. Bach
"Goldberg Variations, BWV 988: Aria"]

00:25:31.915 --> 00:25:33.709 line:80%
No, it's okay.

00:25:33.792 --> 00:25:35.377 line:80%
I'm the one who's not okay.

00:25:39.590 --> 00:25:41.175 line:80%
[thunder rumbles]

00:25:41.258 --> 00:25:42.760 line:80%
Oh… [grunts]

00:25:42.843 --> 00:25:45.471 line:80%
I have another one in my room.
I'll go get it.

00:25:46.138 --> 00:25:47.681 line:80%
-Hang on.
-No, I…

00:25:49.099 --> 00:25:50.601 line:80%
[woman] Hey! Haran!

00:25:51.185 --> 00:25:52.186 line:80%
[woman gasps]

00:25:52.853 --> 00:25:55.022 line:80%
Song Haran! You're actually alive!

00:25:55.105 --> 00:25:56.523 line:80%
[exclaims] Gosh.

00:25:56.607 --> 00:26:01.945 line:80%
You suddenly cut all contact with us
and said you were going to the US.

00:26:02.029 --> 00:26:05.366 line:80%
I went to your workplace, but you quit,
and your number wasn't in service.

00:26:05.449 --> 00:26:07.159 line:80%
I was so worried about you.

00:26:07.701 --> 00:26:08.952 line:80%
I'm glad I bumped into you.

00:26:09.036 --> 00:26:10.996 line:80%
I actually booked a wedding here.

00:26:11.080 --> 00:26:12.247 line:80%
It's next spring.

00:26:12.331 --> 00:26:14.708 line:80%
-You'll be able to see everyone--
-Sorry, Yujeong.

00:26:14.792 --> 00:26:17.002 line:80%
I'm in a hurry right now. Sorry.

00:26:17.086 --> 00:26:18.087 line:80%
Huh?

00:26:18.587 --> 00:26:19.797 line:80%
Haran, wait!

00:26:20.422 --> 00:26:21.507 line:80%
Haran!

00:26:24.677 --> 00:26:27.054 line:80%
-I'll come with you to get the umbrella.
-Pardon?

00:26:27.638 --> 00:26:29.139 line:80%
Huh? Why isn't it here?

00:26:29.223 --> 00:26:30.474 line:80%
[stutters] Hang on.

00:26:31.016 --> 00:26:33.268 line:80%
Ben, my umbrella… Mmm…

00:26:33.352 --> 00:26:34.520 line:80%
Is he not here?

00:26:34.603 --> 00:26:35.854 line:80%
Oh, the concierge…

00:26:35.938 --> 00:26:37.648 line:80%
No, it's fine.

00:26:38.482 --> 00:26:39.483 line:80%
Hello?

00:26:39.566 --> 00:26:42.486 line:80%
Hello. It's Room 3017.

00:26:42.569 --> 00:26:45.406 line:80%
[clock ticking]

00:26:45.489 --> 00:26:47.825 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:27:00.796 --> 00:27:02.423 line:80%
It's taking a while.

00:27:04.550 --> 00:27:05.676 line:80%
I'm sure they'll come.

00:27:06.468 --> 00:27:07.469 line:80%
Right.

00:27:17.688 --> 00:27:19.690 line:80%
-[door beeps, opens]
-Oh! The umbrella…

00:27:19.773 --> 00:27:22.151 line:80%
No, it's Ben.

00:27:22.901 --> 00:27:24.737 line:80%
-Ben.
-[Ben] Oh.

00:27:24.820 --> 00:27:25.904 line:80%
Where were you?

00:27:25.988 --> 00:27:29.199 line:80%
My mother-in-law wanted
to give me some chicken stew.

00:27:29.283 --> 00:27:31.327 line:80%
Oh? Ms. Song?

00:27:31.410 --> 00:27:32.453 line:80%
Hello.

00:27:32.536 --> 00:27:34.955 line:80%
I was dropping off something
and came to borrow an umbrella.

00:27:35.039 --> 00:27:36.999 line:80%
Oh! This is great.

00:27:37.082 --> 00:27:38.709 line:80%
-You can have a meal with us…
-[shouts]

00:27:39.460 --> 00:27:40.794 line:80%
[Chan] An umbrella! [grunts]

00:27:40.878 --> 00:27:42.838 line:80%
-Here. [chuckles]
-[♪ amusing music playing]

00:27:42.921 --> 00:27:44.381 line:80%
You can take this.

00:27:45.215 --> 00:27:48.302 line:80%
-It's pouring, so get home safely.
-Right.

00:27:48.385 --> 00:27:51.722 line:80%
I'll see you at our next meeting.

00:27:53.682 --> 00:27:54.850 line:80%
Bye.

00:27:55.768 --> 00:27:57.478 line:80%
[Chan sighing]

00:28:00.856 --> 00:28:04.526 line:80%
What was that?
You become an idiot in front of Ms. Song.

00:28:04.610 --> 00:28:05.861 line:80%
Is there something going on?

00:28:05.944 --> 00:28:07.237 line:80%
Are you dating?

00:28:07.321 --> 00:28:08.739 line:80%
[sighs wearily]

00:28:09.573 --> 00:28:11.116 line:80%
There is something…

00:28:12.034 --> 00:28:13.661 line:80%
But there shouldn't be.

00:28:14.662 --> 00:28:15.829 line:80%
Ben.

00:28:16.330 --> 00:28:18.374 line:80%
Don't you feel suffocated in this hotel?

00:28:18.957 --> 00:28:21.335 line:80%
Should we just rent a house
while we're here?

00:28:21.418 --> 00:28:24.922 line:80%
Is it the hotel or your own heart
that's suffocating you?

00:28:25.005 --> 00:28:27.091 line:80%
-[Ben laughs]
-[sighs wearily, groans]

00:28:27.174 --> 00:28:29.677 line:80%
[Manjae grunting]

00:28:32.137 --> 00:28:33.347 line:80%
[grunts]

00:28:33.430 --> 00:28:35.766 line:80%
[groans, exhales heavily]

00:28:35.849 --> 00:28:36.892 line:80%
[grunts]

00:28:36.976 --> 00:28:38.852 line:80%
-[groaning]
-[♪ grim music playing]

00:28:38.936 --> 00:28:40.187 line:80%
[barks]

00:28:40.270 --> 00:28:42.439 line:80%
-[whining softly]
-[Manjae groaning]

00:28:43.941 --> 00:28:45.234 line:80%
[groaning]

00:28:45.317 --> 00:28:46.568 line:80%
[barking]

00:28:48.028 --> 00:28:50.572 line:80%
SHIM
Coffee House

00:28:53.826 --> 00:28:55.369 line:80%
It must be closed today.

00:28:55.452 --> 00:28:57.579 line:80%
We've been waiting,
but Mr. Park's not coming.

00:28:57.663 --> 00:28:58.664 line:80%
Thank you.

00:28:58.747 --> 00:29:00.165 line:80%
[woman] Where should we go?

00:29:02.501 --> 00:29:03.711 line:80%
Hey, Genius.

00:29:04.211 --> 00:29:05.212 line:80%
[door thuds shut]

00:29:08.298 --> 00:29:09.967 line:80%
[gasps, mumbles]

00:29:15.222 --> 00:29:17.224 line:80%
I'LL BE BACK SOON

00:29:21.562 --> 00:29:22.771 line:80%
-[man whispers] <i>Hello?</i>
-[gasps softly]

00:29:23.856 --> 00:29:25.691 line:80%
Isn't this Mr. Park's phone?

00:29:25.774 --> 00:29:28.068 line:80%
<i>It is, but he's asleep right now.</i>

00:29:28.152 --> 00:29:29.903 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>I'll take that.</i>

00:29:30.529 --> 00:29:32.323 line:80%
<i>-Hello?</i>
-Hello?

00:29:34.074 --> 00:29:36.702 line:80%
-[camera clicking]
-[Hadam coos, gasps]

00:29:36.785 --> 00:29:40.539 line:80%
-Give me your paw. Good boy! [squeals]
-[camera clicks]

00:29:40.622 --> 00:29:43.459 line:80%
-[giggles] Hi, I'm Genius.
-[♪ happy music playing]

00:29:43.542 --> 00:29:45.586 line:80%
Aren't I big and adorable?

00:29:45.669 --> 00:29:47.004 line:80%
Why is there a dog here?

00:29:47.087 --> 00:29:50.716 line:80%
The owner of a coffee shop
Big Sis is a regular at was hospitalized,

00:29:50.799 --> 00:29:52.551 line:80%
so she said she'd take care of him.

00:29:52.634 --> 00:29:54.678 line:80%
[groans] I wish I could keep him.

00:29:54.762 --> 00:29:56.972 line:80%
Song Hayeong, that little brat.

00:29:57.056 --> 00:29:58.849 line:80%
What? It wasn't Hayeong.

00:29:58.932 --> 00:30:00.184 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:30:00.267 --> 00:30:01.894 line:80%
-What?
-You're here.

00:30:02.394 --> 00:30:05.481 line:80%
[Hadam sighs] Park Genius.
Isn't that such a cute name?

00:30:05.564 --> 00:30:07.524 line:80%
He was named after the coffee shop owner.

00:30:07.608 --> 00:30:09.777 line:80%
-His name's--
-Hadam. Your academy.

00:30:09.860 --> 00:30:12.571 line:80%
[gasps, groans]

00:30:12.655 --> 00:30:16.116 line:80%
Hey, Genius. I'll be back soon. See you.

00:30:16.200 --> 00:30:17.701 line:80%
See you, Grandma.

00:30:20.788 --> 00:30:23.874 line:80%
Were you close enough to someone
to look after their dog?

00:30:23.957 --> 00:30:25.959 line:80%
[chuckles nervously]
Sorry, I brought him without asking.

00:30:26.043 --> 00:30:28.170 line:80%
-[Genius slurping]
-[coos]

00:30:28.962 --> 00:30:30.089 line:80%
[Haran chuckles]

00:30:32.132 --> 00:30:33.884 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:30:36.303 --> 00:30:38.430 line:80%
WE MISS YOU

00:30:38.514 --> 00:30:40.724 line:20%
GET PLENTY OF REST AND FOCUS ON RECOVERING

00:30:47.356 --> 00:30:49.650 line:80%
Should I get some toys for Genius?

00:30:51.819 --> 00:30:54.363 line:80%
You're a dog, and this is a yard.

00:30:55.698 --> 00:30:57.574 line:80%
Run around all you want.

00:30:58.158 --> 00:30:59.743 line:80%
[whines]

00:31:00.536 --> 00:31:02.454 line:80%
-[doorbell rings]
-[Nana sighs]

00:31:03.956 --> 00:31:06.083 line:80%
-[Nana] Who is it?
-[man] Excuse me.

00:31:07.960 --> 00:31:09.545 line:80%
Hello.

00:31:09.628 --> 00:31:12.172 line:80%
-Is my dog Genius here?
-[Genius barks]

00:31:12.256 --> 00:31:13.257 line:80%
Hey, Genius!

00:31:14.216 --> 00:31:16.301 line:80%
-Genius!
-[Genius barks]

00:31:16.385 --> 00:31:19.430 line:80%
[exclaims] Good boy.

00:31:19.513 --> 00:31:22.433 line:80%
You must have been startled
being here without me.

00:31:22.516 --> 00:31:24.685 line:80%
-Good boy.
-Hello.

00:31:24.768 --> 00:31:25.769 line:80%
[Manjae] Ah…

00:31:25.853 --> 00:31:28.647 line:80%
My eldest granddaughter
isn't here right now.

00:31:28.731 --> 00:31:31.066 line:80%
Gosh. Where are my manners?

00:31:31.150 --> 00:31:33.819 line:80%
Thank you so much
for taking care of Genius.

00:31:34.445 --> 00:31:37.031 line:80%
It's fine. It wasn't hard
taking care of him.

00:31:37.614 --> 00:31:38.949 line:80%
But how did you…

00:31:39.033 --> 00:31:40.451 line:80%
I got discharged early.

00:31:41.035 --> 00:31:43.579 line:80%
I heard it was the house
with the coffee-colored door.

00:31:43.662 --> 00:31:47.458 line:80%
I was worried I'd come to the wrong house
for a moment. [chuckles]

00:31:47.541 --> 00:31:49.877 line:80%
I'll thank you formally next time.

00:31:50.794 --> 00:31:52.421 line:80%
-Let's go, Genius.
-Goodbye.

00:31:52.504 --> 00:31:53.505 line:80%
[Manjae] Bye.

00:31:54.006 --> 00:31:55.674 line:80%
[♪ dreamy music playing]

00:31:55.758 --> 00:31:58.844 line:80%
[Hadam] <i>Park Genius.</i>
<i>Isn't that such a cute name?</i>

00:31:58.927 --> 00:32:00.804 line:80%
<i>He was named after the coffee shop owner.</i>

00:32:00.888 --> 00:32:03.265 line:80%
<i>-His name's--</i>
-Park Manjae?

00:32:04.141 --> 00:32:06.727 line:80%
Are you Manjae, who lived in Chuncheon?

00:32:12.191 --> 00:32:13.192 line:80%
Who…

00:32:13.275 --> 00:32:14.443 line:80%
It really is you.

00:32:14.526 --> 00:32:16.612 line:80%
It's me.
The house with the persimmon tree.

00:32:17.780 --> 00:32:18.781 line:80%
Who?

00:32:22.534 --> 00:32:24.203 line:80%
PARK MANJAE

00:32:24.286 --> 00:32:26.914 line:80%
[♪ playing romantic music,
"La Vie En Rose"]

00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:39.927 line:80%
Manjae!

00:32:40.886 --> 00:32:42.513 line:80%
Manjae!

00:32:42.596 --> 00:32:44.264 line:80%
Nabong!

00:32:44.348 --> 00:32:46.850 line:80%
[♪ romantic music playing]

00:32:49.311 --> 00:32:51.188 line:80%
[inaudible]

00:32:59.571 --> 00:33:02.700 line:80%
The fashionista Nabong from Chuncheon?

00:33:02.783 --> 00:33:04.243 line:80%
[giggles]

00:33:04.326 --> 00:33:05.536 line:80%
Yes, it's me.

00:33:05.619 --> 00:33:07.246 line:80%
It's Nabong.

00:33:07.329 --> 00:33:08.580 line:80%
It really is you?

00:33:08.664 --> 00:33:09.665 line:80%
[both laughing]

00:33:09.748 --> 00:33:12.835 line:80%
You're really Nabong? [laughs]

00:33:17.089 --> 00:33:18.090 line:80%
Huh?

00:33:28.767 --> 00:33:30.477 line:80%
Huh? That's…

00:33:31.895 --> 00:33:35.816 line:80%
[Chan] Mr. Park, the clutter box
you're throwing away… [exclaims]

00:33:39.737 --> 00:33:41.655 line:80%
[grunts] Hello.

00:33:41.739 --> 00:33:44.116 line:80%
-[♪ soft emotional music playing]
-What are you doing here?

00:33:45.701 --> 00:33:47.786 line:80%
I'm going to live here. What about you?

00:33:47.870 --> 00:33:50.748 line:80%
You're living here? Why?

00:33:51.582 --> 00:33:53.375 line:80%
I'm close with Mr. Park.

00:33:53.459 --> 00:33:56.045 line:80%
-What brings you here?
-Why are you close?

00:33:56.962 --> 00:33:58.172 line:80%
Why?

00:33:58.881 --> 00:34:02.468 line:80%
The hotel's nearby,
so I came here every day.

00:34:03.218 --> 00:34:06.388 line:80%
And I actually received the exhibit ticket
from Mr. Park

00:34:06.472 --> 00:34:07.765 line:80%
after fixing the ice machine.

00:34:07.848 --> 00:34:10.351 line:80%
Then the regular
who fixed the ice machine…

00:34:13.270 --> 00:34:15.564 line:80%
But why stay here instead of a nice hotel?

00:34:20.736 --> 00:34:22.655 line:80%
-[Chan grunts]
-[Manjae exhales heavily]

00:34:22.738 --> 00:34:24.365 line:80%
You heard the doctor, right?

00:34:24.448 --> 00:34:26.867 line:80%
Make sure to take your meds
and get plenty of sleep.

00:34:26.950 --> 00:34:29.119 line:80%
And no overworking or drinking alcohol.

00:34:29.203 --> 00:34:30.579 line:80%
Enough with the nagging.

00:34:31.372 --> 00:34:32.956 line:80%
My ears are going to bleed.

00:34:33.332 --> 00:34:35.709 line:80%
-Gosh.
-Goodness.

00:34:35.793 --> 00:34:39.046 line:80%
There's nothing like being back home.
[sighs contentedly]

00:34:39.129 --> 00:34:43.175 line:80%
[inhales sharply]
There are a lot of rooms here.

00:34:43.258 --> 00:34:46.261 line:80%
Oh. It's a bit big for one person.

00:34:46.345 --> 00:34:49.431 line:80%
-Mmm-hmm. You must feel lonely--
-[Manjae sighs heavily]

00:34:49.515 --> 00:34:51.809 line:80%
Mr. Park, can you let me
stay in one of the rooms?

00:34:52.393 --> 00:34:55.020 line:80%
Just for three months.
[chuckles] Three months.

00:34:55.104 --> 00:34:59.108 line:80%
I was going to rent a house,
but he had some empty rooms.

00:35:00.234 --> 00:35:03.195 line:80%
And Ben is at his in-law's.
[chuckles softly]

00:35:03.278 --> 00:35:04.613 line:80%
So what brings you here?

00:35:04.697 --> 00:35:07.199 line:80%
Then the regular
who called an ambulance for him…

00:35:07.783 --> 00:35:10.244 line:80%
Hang on. Then it was you
who answered the phone?

00:35:10.327 --> 00:35:15.290 line:80%
Ah. I heard the regular I talked to
on the phone was taking care of Genius.

00:35:15.374 --> 00:35:17.960 line:80%
Yes, that regular is me.

00:35:18.043 --> 00:35:20.337 line:80%
Ah. Regular.

00:35:21.505 --> 00:35:22.673 line:80%
Regular… Mmm.

00:35:25.634 --> 00:35:29.888 line:80%
I think Mr. Park
was around here somewhere.

00:35:29.972 --> 00:35:31.765 line:80%
By the way, is he all right?

00:35:31.849 --> 00:35:33.642 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>I'm all right.</i>

00:35:35.352 --> 00:35:37.938 line:80%
They said
it's variant angina or something.

00:35:39.523 --> 00:35:41.066 line:80%
I just have to take medicine.

00:35:41.900 --> 00:35:44.111 line:80%
By the way, it's been so long.

00:35:44.194 --> 00:35:47.698 line:80%
You suddenly disappeared
from Chuncheon one day.

00:35:47.781 --> 00:35:49.908 line:80%
It's been over 50 years.

00:35:49.992 --> 00:35:53.662 line:80%
But I'm quite famous now.
You really didn't know?

00:35:53.746 --> 00:35:56.332 line:80%
Well, I knew the name Nana Kim,

00:35:56.415 --> 00:35:59.501 line:80%
but I never imagined
it would be you. [laughs]

00:35:59.585 --> 00:36:03.714 line:80%
Gosh, you were always
going on about <i>la vie en rose,</i>

00:36:03.797 --> 00:36:07.634 line:80%
and you really went to France
and achieved that dream.

00:36:07.718 --> 00:36:09.386 line:80%
[both chuckling]

00:36:09.470 --> 00:36:14.475 line:80%
But I've been running a coffee shop
in this neighborhood for over 10 years.

00:36:14.558 --> 00:36:18.479 line:80%
How is it that
we never ran into each other?

00:36:18.562 --> 00:36:20.189 line:80%
That's how the world is.

00:36:20.856 --> 00:36:24.610 line:80%
It can feel small at times
but big at others. [chuckles softly]

00:36:24.693 --> 00:36:28.739 line:80%
But how did you get so close
to my granddaughter?

00:36:28.822 --> 00:36:31.784 line:80%
She never lets anyone get close to her.

00:36:31.867 --> 00:36:34.787 line:80%
She's a regular at my coffee shop.

00:36:34.870 --> 00:36:38.332 line:80%
She stays there
almost every day until I close.

00:36:40.292 --> 00:36:42.795 line:80%
I wondered where she was staying out
so late every day.

00:36:43.545 --> 00:36:44.880 line:80%
She was there?

00:36:44.963 --> 00:36:46.256 line:80%
[♪ soft sentimental music playing]

00:36:46.340 --> 00:36:47.675 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:36:47.758 --> 00:36:49.176 line:80%
I guess she felt more at ease

00:36:50.427 --> 00:36:53.097 line:80%
at your coffee shop than at home with me.

00:36:53.931 --> 00:36:56.308 line:80%
I guess you did something for her
that I couldn't.

00:36:56.976 --> 00:37:00.062 line:80%
-Thanks.
-All I did was give her coffee.

00:37:00.145 --> 00:37:01.689 line:80%
I didn't do anything special.

00:37:04.108 --> 00:37:05.317 line:80%
It's been seven years,

00:37:06.318 --> 00:37:08.612 line:80%
but I never knew

00:37:10.114 --> 00:37:11.865 line:80%
she had a place to rely on.

00:37:11.949 --> 00:37:12.950 line:80%
Seven years?

00:37:14.034 --> 00:37:17.746 line:80%
That's around the time I first met her.

00:37:19.039 --> 00:37:20.582 line:80%
I think it was around summer.

00:37:21.625 --> 00:37:23.836 line:80%
I'm not sure if it's okay to ask this,

00:37:24.586 --> 00:37:27.047 line:80%
but did something happen to her

00:37:27.715 --> 00:37:29.049 line:80%
back then?

00:37:33.262 --> 00:37:34.763 line:80%
[rain pattering]

00:37:37.057 --> 00:37:39.560 line:80%
-[shop bell chimes]
-[Manjae exclaiming]

00:37:40.602 --> 00:37:41.645 line:80%
My gosh.

00:37:42.646 --> 00:37:45.399 line:80%
Hey, Genius.

00:37:45.899 --> 00:37:47.526 line:80%
It's raining cats and dogs.

00:37:48.068 --> 00:37:49.695 line:80%
It's pouring, isn't it?

00:37:50.779 --> 00:37:55.993 line:80%
<i>It was a day when it suddenly poured.</i>

00:37:57.119 --> 00:37:59.121 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:38:01.623 --> 00:38:04.126 line:80%
<i>But she was sitting in the rain,</i>

00:38:05.002 --> 00:38:06.170 line:80%
<i>crying.</i>

00:38:06.253 --> 00:38:08.255 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:38:11.133 --> 00:38:13.469 line:80%
[Nana] <i>Her boyfriend died back then.</i>

00:38:14.386 --> 00:38:17.514 line:80%
<i>He went to study in Boston,</i>
<i>but he suddenly died.</i>

00:38:17.598 --> 00:38:19.475 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music continues]

00:38:29.276 --> 00:38:30.903 line:80%
[cell phone ringing]

00:38:31.862 --> 00:38:32.863 line:80%
[box thuds]

00:38:35.741 --> 00:38:37.034 line:80%
-[grunts]
-[ringing continues]

00:38:37.117 --> 00:38:38.619 line:80%
[chuckles nervously, grunts]

00:38:40.287 --> 00:38:41.413 line:80%
[Chan exclaims]

00:38:42.623 --> 00:38:43.707 line:80%
[groans, inhales sharply]

00:38:43.791 --> 00:38:45.334 line:80%
BEN

00:38:46.043 --> 00:38:47.044 line:80%
[groans]

00:38:48.045 --> 00:38:50.381 line:80%
[stammers] You're getting a call…

00:38:50.464 --> 00:38:51.507 line:80%
Can you…

00:38:52.091 --> 00:38:55.177 line:80%
Can you hold it
on the other side? [grunts softly]

00:38:56.428 --> 00:38:57.930 line:80%
[grunts, inhales sharply]

00:38:58.764 --> 00:39:00.057 line:80%
Yes.

00:39:00.140 --> 00:39:01.433 line:80%
Hey, Ben.

00:39:02.142 --> 00:39:03.852 line:80%
[stutters] A meeting on Monday?

00:39:03.936 --> 00:39:05.813 line:80%
Okay. Bye.

00:39:06.939 --> 00:39:09.358 line:80%
Thank you. Can you put it here?

00:39:10.067 --> 00:39:11.652 line:80%
-Right. [grunts]
-[door opens]

00:39:11.735 --> 00:39:12.861 line:80%
[exclaims]

00:39:12.945 --> 00:39:15.155 line:80%
[in English] I'm back!

00:39:15.239 --> 00:39:16.865 line:80%
Genius, house!

00:39:16.949 --> 00:39:18.575 line:80%
[in Korean] Were you at our house?

00:39:19.159 --> 00:39:22.121 line:80%
You only just got discharged.
You should've called me.

00:39:22.204 --> 00:39:26.041 line:80%
It's the first time I've heard you talk
this much in seven years.

00:39:26.125 --> 00:39:28.460 line:80%
[chuckles awkwardly] Are you all right?

00:39:28.544 --> 00:39:30.212 line:80%
Yes, thanks to you.

00:39:30.295 --> 00:39:34.967 line:80%
But it's a surprise seeing
my VVIP regulars here together.

00:39:35.050 --> 00:39:36.135 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:39:36.218 --> 00:39:38.095 line:80%
Roomie, say hi. She's…

00:39:38.178 --> 00:39:40.264 line:80%
Oh. I know her.

00:39:40.347 --> 00:39:42.933 line:80%
She's a designer
at the company I'm working with.

00:39:43.017 --> 00:39:45.602 line:80%
You were working with Nabong…

00:39:45.686 --> 00:39:48.314 line:80%
I mean, the designer Nana Kim?

00:39:48.397 --> 00:39:50.607 line:80%
How do you know my grandmother's name?

00:39:50.691 --> 00:39:52.693 line:80%
It turns out she was my childhood friend.

00:39:52.776 --> 00:39:54.069 line:80%
Oh, really?

00:39:54.153 --> 00:39:56.905 line:80%
We lived in the same neighborhood
for 10 years, but I never knew.

00:39:56.989 --> 00:39:58.282 line:80%
I was so excited,

00:39:58.365 --> 00:40:01.243 line:80%
-I almost did a backflip.
-[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:40:01.327 --> 00:40:02.703 line:80%
[laughs]

00:40:03.746 --> 00:40:05.497 line:80%
Right, I forgot.

00:40:05.581 --> 00:40:06.874 line:80%
Thank you.

00:40:06.957 --> 00:40:10.085 line:80%
You locked the doors for me
and even looked after Genius.

00:40:10.169 --> 00:40:11.253 line:80%
It's nothing.

00:40:11.337 --> 00:40:14.423 line:80%
And you can talk to me informally.
You're Grandma's friend.

00:40:14.506 --> 00:40:17.760 line:80%
Then should I start
talking to you casually?

00:40:18.552 --> 00:40:19.595 line:80%
Like a friend.

00:40:19.678 --> 00:40:21.764 line:80%
-Ah. Yes.
-[Manjae chuckles]

00:40:22.264 --> 00:40:24.558 line:80%
This is the first time
I've seen you smile like that too.

00:40:24.642 --> 00:40:25.809 line:80%
[chuckles awkwardly]

00:40:26.435 --> 00:40:29.229 line:80%
But… you must feel comfortable
on your own.

00:40:29.313 --> 00:40:31.273 line:80%
Why did you let him live here?

00:40:31.357 --> 00:40:32.816 line:80%
[clears throat]

00:40:33.484 --> 00:40:36.362 line:80%
I thought I'd feel safer
if there was someone with me.

00:40:37.154 --> 00:40:39.657 line:80%
And he's adorable.

00:40:40.658 --> 00:40:42.868 line:80%
He's a really good man.

00:40:44.370 --> 00:40:46.163 line:80%
Come sit down. I'll make you coffee.

00:40:46.246 --> 00:40:48.165 line:80%
No, it's fine. Get some rest.

00:40:48.248 --> 00:40:51.168 line:80%
Even if I don't drink coffee,

00:40:51.251 --> 00:40:54.463 line:80%
is it okay to stay here
until closing hours?

00:40:55.881 --> 00:41:00.344 line:80%
You're young.
You should be having fun outside.

00:41:00.844 --> 00:41:03.097 line:80%
You shouldn't stay cooped up
in this boring place.

00:41:03.180 --> 00:41:05.182 line:80%
This place is the most fun for me.

00:41:05.265 --> 00:41:06.475 line:80%
I can focus on work,

00:41:06.558 --> 00:41:09.561 line:80%
and I feel at ease
because it feels like nothing will happen.

00:41:10.396 --> 00:41:11.397 line:80%
Mmm.

00:41:16.110 --> 00:41:17.319 line:80%
[elevator dings]

00:41:21.323 --> 00:41:24.326 line:80%
Bring the <i>dancheong </i>data
I mentioned to my office.

00:41:24.410 --> 00:41:26.161 line:80%
I'll give you the files now.

00:41:26.245 --> 00:41:28.580 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:41:28.664 --> 00:41:30.290 line:80%
If it's a work call, take it.

00:41:30.374 --> 00:41:31.542 line:80%
Mr. Yeon, take the files.

00:41:31.625 --> 00:41:32.710 line:80%
-Sure.
-Here.

00:41:35.170 --> 00:41:36.922 line:80%
-Hello.
-Here, Ms. Kim.

00:41:37.006 --> 00:41:39.258 line:80%
I called about the fabric materials.

00:41:39.341 --> 00:41:41.844 line:80%
Yes, I'd like the 0.8 mm ones.

00:41:41.927 --> 00:41:44.179 line:80%
SEONU CHAN

00:41:44.263 --> 00:41:46.307 line:80%
-Ah, yes.
-[Nana] <i>She…</i>

00:41:46.390 --> 00:41:48.183 line:80%
-Thank you.
<i>-</i>[Nana] <i>She was with a guy.</i>

00:41:49.143 --> 00:41:51.687 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:42:14.418 --> 00:42:17.296 line:80%
[Ben] It's an original character
that Chan created.

00:42:17.379 --> 00:42:20.883 line:80%
That character. Was it based on someone?

00:42:22.217 --> 00:42:24.094 line:80%
No, it just came to mind.

00:42:25.262 --> 00:42:29.475 line:80%
He drew his ideal type,
but he met her in real life?

00:42:32.561 --> 00:42:35.898 line:80%
Mr. Yeon, keep an eye on Ms. Song

00:42:36.857 --> 00:42:38.025 line:80%
and Seonu Chan.

00:42:38.776 --> 00:42:39.943 line:80%
Yes, ma'am.

00:42:45.824 --> 00:42:47.785 line:80%
[exclaims] That expression.

00:42:47.868 --> 00:42:51.038 line:80%
You look like a robot that's been given
an order you can't refuse.

00:42:51.121 --> 00:42:53.248 line:80%
-It's not like that.
-[♪ playful music playing]

00:42:53.332 --> 00:42:54.792 line:80%
What is it? Did Grandma…

00:42:55.751 --> 00:42:58.253 line:80%
I mean, did Ms. Kim order you
to do something again?

00:42:58.337 --> 00:42:59.380 line:80%
No, she didn't.

00:42:59.463 --> 00:43:01.298 line:80%
"No, she didn't"?

00:43:01.382 --> 00:43:03.592 line:80%
All right. Then keep working
in your robot mode.

00:43:03.676 --> 00:43:05.803 line:80%
Beep, beep, beep.

00:43:06.470 --> 00:43:08.472 line:80%
[Hayeong imitating robot beeping]

00:43:09.765 --> 00:43:12.810 line:80%
[chuckles] It's pretty fun teasing him.

00:43:12.893 --> 00:43:14.228 line:80%
[Chan] Let's take a photo.

00:43:14.311 --> 00:43:15.354 line:80%
One plus one is what?

00:43:15.437 --> 00:43:16.563 line:80%
[all] Two.

00:43:16.647 --> 00:43:17.773 line:80%
[camera clicks]

00:43:19.024 --> 00:43:20.150 line:80%
[Hayeong exclaims]

00:43:21.652 --> 00:43:23.487 line:80%
[Seung-gyu] I'm a huge animation fan.

00:43:23.570 --> 00:43:24.822 line:80%
Where did you learn art?

00:43:24.905 --> 00:43:26.115 line:80%
At CalArts.

00:43:26.198 --> 00:43:30.160 line:80%
[exclaims] CalArts? That's insane!

00:43:30.244 --> 00:43:33.872 line:80%
-Sweetie, can you draw me a caricature…
-[Hayeong and Sol laugh]

00:43:33.956 --> 00:43:36.125 line:80%
-…with your professional skills?
-Sure.

00:43:36.208 --> 00:43:37.334 line:80%
[Hayeong] Me too.

00:43:37.418 --> 00:43:38.419 line:80%
-[Seung-gyu] Me too.
-What?

00:43:38.502 --> 00:43:40.713 line:80%
-[Sol] I'll get some paper.
-When did they get so close?

00:43:40.796 --> 00:43:42.297 line:80%
Is he a capybara or what?

00:43:42.965 --> 00:43:44.425 line:80%
[Remy] Is this better, or this?

00:43:45.134 --> 00:43:47.302 line:80%
-[Seung-gyu] The second one.
-[Remy] Is this better?

00:43:48.679 --> 00:43:50.222 line:80%
How should I pose for this?

00:43:50.306 --> 00:43:51.432 line:80%
Like this?

00:43:51.640 --> 00:43:53.058 line:80%
[Chan] Hmm. [sighs]

00:43:54.393 --> 00:43:56.061 line:80%
Using a <i>dancheong </i>pattern

00:43:56.145 --> 00:43:59.356 line:80%
to show that she's Korean
just with her outfit…

00:44:00.149 --> 00:44:03.152 line:80%
Wow. This might be a problem.

00:44:06.071 --> 00:44:07.906 line:80%
Because it's so good. [chuckles]

00:44:10.534 --> 00:44:15.331 line:80%
Then let's develop this
with <i>dancheong </i>as the basic concept.

00:44:15.414 --> 00:44:18.709 line:80%
All right. I'll send this to HQ
and schedule a video call.

00:44:20.627 --> 00:44:23.505 line:80%
-I feel a bit hungry.
-[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:44:23.589 --> 00:44:27.009 line:80%
I'd like to continue our discussion
over dinner. Are you free?

00:44:27.092 --> 00:44:29.219 line:80%
Yes, I'd love that.

00:44:29.303 --> 00:44:31.347 line:80%
How about the new
Italian restaurant nearby?

00:44:31.430 --> 00:44:32.640 line:80%
It seemed really wild.

00:44:33.932 --> 00:44:37.645 line:80%
Your appetite must be wild too.
No wonder your jawline disappeared.

00:44:41.273 --> 00:44:42.274 line:80%
Have dinner without me.

00:44:46.779 --> 00:44:47.780 line:80%
What do you like?

00:44:48.405 --> 00:44:49.990 line:80%
You can eat without me. I--

00:44:50.074 --> 00:44:52.576 line:80%
You're joining.
I said we're discussing work.

00:44:57.665 --> 00:44:59.875 line:80%
[♪ elegant piano music
playing on speakers]

00:45:08.967 --> 00:45:11.220 line:80%
They look good together.

00:45:11.929 --> 00:45:13.013 line:80%
What?

00:45:14.431 --> 00:45:16.767 line:80%
I said the interior is nice.

00:45:21.689 --> 00:45:23.148 line:80%
Hello?

00:45:23.232 --> 00:45:24.733 line:80%
All right.

00:45:25.734 --> 00:45:28.696 line:80%
Sorry, I have to go.
Something urgent came up.

00:45:28.779 --> 00:45:29.822 line:80%
Then let's--

00:45:29.905 --> 00:45:32.116 line:80%
Sit. I didn't mean you were going.

00:45:33.534 --> 00:45:35.911 line:80%
I'm sorry. Enjoy your dinner.

00:45:36.787 --> 00:45:37.830 line:80%
See you at the meeting,

00:45:37.913 --> 00:45:41.291 line:80%
Animator Seonu Chan.

00:45:42.543 --> 00:45:44.169 line:80%
Right. I'll see you at the meeting.

00:45:52.594 --> 00:45:56.015 line:80%
[inhales sharply]
If you feel uncomfortable, we can just…

00:45:56.098 --> 00:45:57.641 line:80%
Here are the menus.

00:45:58.642 --> 00:46:00.769 line:80%
I'm sorry, but we'll just…

00:46:02.604 --> 00:46:07.568 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>You should at least buy him</i>
<i>dinner and thank him in person…</i>

00:46:07.651 --> 00:46:08.944 line:80%
Let's just eat.

00:46:09.028 --> 00:46:10.654 line:80%
I'll buy.

00:46:10.738 --> 00:46:11.864 line:80%
What?

00:46:11.947 --> 00:46:14.575 line:80%
Ah. Okay…

00:46:17.244 --> 00:46:18.829 line:80%
Can you recommend something?

00:46:18.912 --> 00:46:21.915 line:80%
-Take your time. Just look here.
-Ah.

00:46:21.999 --> 00:46:25.461 line:80%
Our rollatini is our signature dish,
made with sliced eggplants…

00:46:25.544 --> 00:46:28.672 line:80%
-She doesn't like eggplants.
-How did you know I don't like eggplants?

00:46:29.882 --> 00:46:31.383 line:80%
What? Oh…

00:46:32.676 --> 00:46:34.345 line:80%
Many people dislike eggplants.

00:46:34.428 --> 00:46:36.096 line:80%
Right?

00:46:36.180 --> 00:46:37.556 line:80%
-[waiter] Right…
-Me too.

00:46:37.640 --> 00:46:39.642 line:80%
I dislike them as well.

00:46:39.725 --> 00:46:42.603 line:80%
Can you just give me
something you can prepare quickly?

00:46:42.686 --> 00:46:44.813 line:80%
-Me too.
-All right.

00:46:48.150 --> 00:46:49.318 line:80%
[sighs contentedly]

00:46:49.401 --> 00:46:52.488 line:80%
-The interior really is nice.
-[cell phone buzzes]

00:46:53.238 --> 00:46:54.239 line:80%
[Chan sighs]

00:46:54.823 --> 00:46:57.618 line:80%
[Nana] <i>Repetition means</i>
<i>your heart has already stirred.</i>

00:46:57.701 --> 00:47:00.954 line:80%
<i>Instead of writing his name over and over,</i>
<i>follow your heart.</i>

00:47:01.038 --> 00:47:02.081 line:80%
"Name"?

00:47:03.332 --> 00:47:04.750 line:80%
[Nana] Mr. Yeon, take the files.

00:47:13.717 --> 00:47:15.010 line:80%
[sighs, mumbles]

00:47:15.844 --> 00:47:17.513 line:80%
Let me apologize first.

00:47:19.515 --> 00:47:20.557 line:20%
SEONU CHAN

00:47:20.641 --> 00:47:22.768 line:20%
Oh? Why is my name there?

00:47:22.851 --> 00:47:23.978 line:80%
Well…

00:47:25.020 --> 00:47:28.232 line:80%
I wrote this when I thought
you were my stalker,

00:47:28.315 --> 00:47:31.735 line:80%
but I think Ms. Kim saw this
and thought I had feelings for you.

00:47:31.819 --> 00:47:34.446 line:80%
That's probably why
we ended up having dinner alone.

00:47:34.530 --> 00:47:35.864 line:80%
Ah…

00:47:36.657 --> 00:47:37.741 line:80%
[sighs]

00:47:38.951 --> 00:47:40.327 line:80%
I'll explain this to her…

00:47:40.411 --> 00:47:42.955 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>Just pretend</i>
<i>you're seeing someone.</i>

00:47:43.038 --> 00:47:46.000 line:80%
<i>That will save you from a lot of nagging.</i>

00:47:46.083 --> 00:47:49.044 line:80%
I should tell her…

00:47:50.045 --> 00:47:51.588 line:80%
But is it okay if I don't?

00:47:52.673 --> 00:47:53.966 line:80%
Pardon?

00:47:54.049 --> 00:47:55.551 line:80%
It's a bit complicated,

00:47:55.634 --> 00:47:58.220 line:80%
but I think
this will be a good opportunity

00:47:58.303 --> 00:48:00.389 line:80%
to put my grandmother's mind at ease.

00:48:01.140 --> 00:48:04.059 line:80%
Oh. Sure.

00:48:04.852 --> 00:48:07.271 line:80%
If it helps you, then it's fine with me.

00:48:08.230 --> 00:48:11.108 line:80%
Thank you. I'll make sure
this won't cause you any trouble.

00:48:11.817 --> 00:48:12.901 line:80%
All right.

00:48:12.985 --> 00:48:14.278 line:80%
[speaker squeaks]

00:48:14.361 --> 00:48:15.362 line:80%
[grunts]

00:48:15.446 --> 00:48:17.740 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:48:20.868 --> 00:48:24.038 line:80%
There must have been
an issue with the connection. I'm sorry.

00:48:24.121 --> 00:48:25.456 line:80%
It's fine.

00:48:25.539 --> 00:48:27.958 line:80%
[♪ elegant classical music
playing on speakers]

00:48:36.425 --> 00:48:37.968 line:80%
[Nana] <i>How did the two seem?</i>

00:48:39.178 --> 00:48:41.013 line:80%
[Taeseok] I'm not sure yet.

00:48:41.096 --> 00:48:42.097 line:20%
REPRESENTATIVE
KIM NANA

00:48:43.098 --> 00:48:45.392 line:80%
I set things up for them,
so we'll know soon.

00:48:46.435 --> 00:48:48.687 line:80%
-You can go now.
-I'll take you home.

00:48:48.771 --> 00:48:50.648 line:80%
I'm not a child. I can go home by myself.

00:48:51.315 --> 00:48:53.984 line:80%
You don't look well these days.

00:48:54.068 --> 00:48:56.528 line:80%
And you haven't gotten
any checkups for years.

00:48:58.697 --> 00:49:01.408 line:80%
At least take these. They're vitamins.

00:49:03.202 --> 00:49:06.080 line:80%
You're not my chauffeur
or secretary anymore.

00:49:06.580 --> 00:49:09.833 line:80%
If you've become the COO,
you should stop doing such things.

00:49:09.917 --> 00:49:12.586 line:80%
Why would a COO take care
of my granddaughters as well?

00:49:13.379 --> 00:49:15.297 line:80%
I'm doing it because I want to.

00:49:15.881 --> 00:49:17.132 line:80%
Then don't work too late.

00:49:23.973 --> 00:49:24.974 line:80%
[door closes]

00:49:27.184 --> 00:49:28.435 line:80%
[sighs]

00:49:33.232 --> 00:49:35.275 line:80%
I wonder what they're up to now.

00:49:36.110 --> 00:49:38.904 line:80%
[♪ elegant classical music continuing]

00:49:43.409 --> 00:49:46.745 line:80%
Sorry, I shouldn't have asked
what I did earlier.

00:49:46.829 --> 00:49:48.080 line:80%
I'll take that back…

00:49:48.664 --> 00:49:50.874 line:80%
-[groans softly, inhales sharply]
-[cutlery scraping]

00:49:50.958 --> 00:49:53.168 line:80%
-Are you not feeling well?
-What?

00:49:55.796 --> 00:49:58.507 line:80%
-[grunts]
-[high-pitched ringing]

00:49:58.590 --> 00:49:59.967 line:80%
-[whooshes]
-[grunts softly]

00:50:00.050 --> 00:50:01.593 line:80%
-[ice cubes crunch]
-[clattering]

00:50:01.677 --> 00:50:04.013 line:80%
-[grunts softly]
-[clinking]

00:50:04.096 --> 00:50:05.389 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:50:05.472 --> 00:50:06.473 line:80%
-[glasses clink]
-[corks pop]

00:50:06.557 --> 00:50:08.058 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:50:08.142 --> 00:50:09.268 line:80%
Excuse me…

00:50:10.060 --> 00:50:11.478 line:80%
-[server 1 yelps]
-[shatters]

00:50:13.397 --> 00:50:14.398 line:80%
[gasps]

00:50:14.523 --> 00:50:15.816 line:80%
[server 1 exclaims]

00:50:16.817 --> 00:50:18.652 line:80%
I'm so sorry. I'll pay for all this.

00:50:18.736 --> 00:50:20.821 line:80%
Can you put in the order again?
Just a moment, please.

00:50:21.405 --> 00:50:22.531 line:80%
All right.

00:50:24.366 --> 00:50:26.577 line:80%
[server 2] I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:50:28.287 --> 00:50:30.289 line:80%
[♪ tense music continues]

00:50:32.166 --> 00:50:34.543 line:80%
-[breathing heavily]
-[door opens, closes]

00:50:35.502 --> 00:50:37.463 line:80%
Are you okay? Do you feel dizzy?

00:50:39.089 --> 00:50:40.507 line:80%
[sighs] Is there a pharmacy nearby?

00:50:42.259 --> 00:50:45.846 line:80%
I'm sorry.
I don't do well in noisy places.

00:50:46.513 --> 00:50:48.599 line:80%
-Is it hard being around crowds?
-No.

00:50:50.059 --> 00:50:51.226 line:80%
Mmm…

00:50:51.310 --> 00:50:52.936 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:50:54.521 --> 00:50:55.939 line:80%
[inhales deeply]

00:50:56.023 --> 00:50:58.734 line:80%
-I can't hear… on this side.
-[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:50:59.943 --> 00:51:01.945 line:80%
I'm usually fine,

00:51:02.029 --> 00:51:04.740 line:80%
but the sounds get mixed up
when it's noisy inside.

00:51:05.366 --> 00:51:07.451 line:80%
And I can't even hear
the person right in front of me.

00:51:07.534 --> 00:51:10.371 line:80%
It's hard to tell
the direction of the sounds.

00:51:11.955 --> 00:51:13.207 line:80%
Excuse me.

00:51:13.290 --> 00:51:15.793 line:80%
Excuse me! No, not that way…

00:51:15.876 --> 00:51:18.295 line:80%
Can you hold it on the other side?

00:51:18.379 --> 00:51:20.506 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music continuing]

00:51:21.340 --> 00:51:24.051 line:80%
But I'm a skilled artist, I'm friendly,

00:51:24.134 --> 00:51:26.220 line:80%
and with my looks… [chuckles]

00:51:26.303 --> 00:51:27.388 line:80%
What?

00:51:28.263 --> 00:51:31.725 line:80%
I'm a really lucky guy besides the fact
that I can't hear on one side,

00:51:32.393 --> 00:51:34.561 line:80%
so you don't have to look at me like that.

00:51:35.688 --> 00:51:37.106 line:80%
[Chan inhales sharply]

00:51:37.189 --> 00:51:40.150 line:80%
[sighs] I'll go deal
with the mess I caused in there.

00:51:40.776 --> 00:51:43.946 line:80%
No, it's noisy in there.
I'll go bring our stuff.

00:51:48.492 --> 00:51:50.536 line:80%
[door opens, closes]

00:51:50.619 --> 00:51:51.996 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:51:52.079 --> 00:51:53.205 line:80%
I…

00:51:53.998 --> 00:51:54.999 line:80%
Hang on.

00:52:00.671 --> 00:52:02.756 line:80%
Excuse me for a moment.

00:52:07.177 --> 00:52:09.179 line:80%
[♪ tender song playing]

00:52:23.736 --> 00:52:27.364 line:80%
I'm just taking care
of your ruined clothes, as a designer.

00:52:27.448 --> 00:52:29.491 line:80%
It's not because I feel bad or anything.

00:52:30.075 --> 00:52:33.162 line:80%
-Why are you drawing a line like that?
-Think however you want.

00:52:33.245 --> 00:52:34.246 line:80%
Thank you.

00:52:38.417 --> 00:52:39.668 line:80%
Thanks

00:52:40.836 --> 00:52:41.837 line:80%
for caring.

00:52:50.220 --> 00:52:52.014 line:80%
I took care of it for now.

00:52:52.097 --> 00:52:53.265 line:80%
There.

00:52:53.349 --> 00:52:55.184 line:80%
No, you'll catch a cold…

00:52:55.267 --> 00:52:56.977 line:80%
It was just to style my outfit.

00:52:57.811 --> 00:53:00.481 line:80%
I'll tell my grandmother
she had a misunderstanding.

00:53:00.564 --> 00:53:02.650 line:80%
It's a good opportunity.
It's fine with me--

00:53:02.733 --> 00:53:05.194 line:80%
I'm not fine with it.

00:53:05.861 --> 00:53:07.196 line:80%
I don't like feeling indebted.

00:53:08.530 --> 00:53:10.407 line:80%
Anyway, I'll bring our stuff.

00:53:18.374 --> 00:53:21.752 line:80%
[Chan] <i>How did you get close to Ms. Song?</i>

00:53:22.378 --> 00:53:25.255 line:80%
[Manjae] What? Well… [chuckles]

00:53:26.006 --> 00:53:29.718 line:20%
I think we're close,
but I'm not sure about her.

00:53:30.427 --> 00:53:31.762 line:80%
But why do you ask?

00:53:31.845 --> 00:53:32.930 line:80%
Well…

00:53:34.056 --> 00:53:35.766 line:80%
It feels like she always draws a line

00:53:36.433 --> 00:53:38.394 line:80%
and doesn't let me cross it.

00:53:39.186 --> 00:53:40.813 line:80%
She didn't use to…

00:53:43.148 --> 00:53:46.902 line:80%
It just feels like it's hard
to get close to her. [chuckles]

00:53:46.986 --> 00:53:50.030 line:80%
I've seen her every day
for the past seven years,

00:53:50.114 --> 00:53:53.325 line:80%
but I had no idea what she did
or where she lived.

00:53:53.409 --> 00:53:55.327 line:80%
She never talks about herself.

00:53:57.913 --> 00:54:00.666 line:80%
-[♪ soft pleasant music playing]
<i>-She was always drawing clothes,</i>

00:54:01.208 --> 00:54:04.378 line:80%
<i>so I just assumed she was a designer.</i>

00:54:05.295 --> 00:54:08.757 line:80%
<i>She always came by herself</i>
<i>and stayed here quietly.</i>

00:54:08.841 --> 00:54:10.259 line:80%
-[rain pattering]
-[Manjae exclaims]

00:54:10.926 --> 00:54:13.262 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Did she ever come with anyone else?</i>

00:54:13.345 --> 00:54:14.638 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>No, never.</i>

00:54:14.722 --> 00:54:16.265 line:80%
<i>Not once in seven years.</i>

00:54:17.016 --> 00:54:18.934 line:80%
<i>She was always by herself.</i>

00:54:19.768 --> 00:54:20.811 line:80%
<i>Always.</i>

00:54:22.187 --> 00:54:25.691 line:80%
[Haran sneezing]

00:54:25.774 --> 00:54:26.817 line:80%
[sighs]

00:54:27.651 --> 00:54:29.611 line:80%
Did you catch a cold?

00:54:29.695 --> 00:54:31.655 line:80%
No, I was just sneezing.

00:54:31.739 --> 00:54:32.823 line:80%
[sneezes]

00:54:34.199 --> 00:54:35.409 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:54:37.786 --> 00:54:38.912 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:54:39.913 --> 00:54:42.624 line:80%
-Huh? Where did it go?
-[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:54:48.088 --> 00:54:50.257 line:80%
Gosh, you're stirring up dust.

00:54:50.341 --> 00:54:51.383 line:80%
What are you doing?

00:54:51.467 --> 00:54:53.594 line:80%
I can't find my drawing pen.

00:54:55.095 --> 00:54:56.305 line:80%
Where did it go?

00:55:01.226 --> 00:55:03.437 line:80%
Where are you going?
It's time for our meeting.

00:55:04.855 --> 00:55:06.065 line:80%
[sighs]

00:55:07.983 --> 00:55:08.984 line:80%
[sighs]

00:55:09.068 --> 00:55:11.236 line:80%
[in English] <i>I really liked</i>
<i>the, uh... the </i>dancheong <i>idea.</i>

00:55:11.320 --> 00:55:13.614 line:80%
<i>So could you tell me</i>
<i>a little bit more about it?</i>

00:55:13.697 --> 00:55:17.159 line:80%
Of course.
Director Song will go over it for you.

00:55:17.242 --> 00:55:18.369 line:80%
Director Song?

00:55:21.789 --> 00:55:24.333 line:80%
[Hayeong coughing, speaking Korean]
The data overview.

00:55:25.626 --> 00:55:27.127 line:80%
Oh, the data…

00:55:28.921 --> 00:55:32.257 line:80%
[in English] <i>Dancheong </i>is
a traditional Korean coloring technique.

00:55:32.341 --> 00:55:33.342 line:80%
[in Korean] Thank you.

00:55:33.425 --> 00:55:36.053 line:80%
[Nana in English]
Commonly found in palaces and temples.

00:55:36.637 --> 00:55:40.432 line:80%
It involves painting
wooden architecture with…

00:55:40.516 --> 00:55:43.894 line:20%
<i>Okay, so I'll see you at the next meeting.</i>
<i>We'll talk more about it then.</i>

00:55:43.978 --> 00:55:45.187 line:80%
<i>All right. Bye-bye, everybody.</i>

00:55:45.270 --> 00:55:46.313 line:80%
[all] Bye!

00:55:46.397 --> 00:55:47.606 line:80%
[Ben] See you.

00:55:48.941 --> 00:55:51.944 line:80%
[Remy sighs, speaking Korean]
Great work, everyone.

00:55:53.362 --> 00:55:54.446 line:80%
[clears throat]

00:55:57.199 --> 00:55:58.701 line:80%
What kind of attitude was that?

00:55:59.952 --> 00:56:02.121 line:80%
I'm sorry, but I have to go.

00:56:09.545 --> 00:56:10.921 line:80%
[sighs]

00:56:11.714 --> 00:56:12.715 line:80%
[sighs]

00:56:14.967 --> 00:56:17.469 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:56:19.221 --> 00:56:20.723 line:80%
[gasping]

00:56:20.806 --> 00:56:22.016 line:80%
Gosh. It's not here!

00:56:23.809 --> 00:56:26.395 line:80%
Hang on. Where did I last use it?

00:56:27.187 --> 00:56:28.564 line:80%
Right. The restaurant!

00:56:28.647 --> 00:56:30.649 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:56:34.194 --> 00:56:35.487 line:80%
The restaurant?

00:56:37.239 --> 00:56:39.074 line:80%
NAUM LOST-AND-FOUND LIST

00:56:42.244 --> 00:56:44.121 line:80%
We haven't found anything like that.

00:56:45.289 --> 00:56:47.082 line:80%
Could I search for it myself?

00:56:47.166 --> 00:56:48.834 line:80%
There are customers eating inside.

00:56:48.917 --> 00:56:52.212 line:80%
But if you dropped it,
we would have found it while cleaning.

00:56:52.296 --> 00:56:53.380 line:80%
[sighs]

00:56:54.048 --> 00:56:58.177 line:80%
I'm really sorry,
but can I take a look after you're closed?

00:56:58.260 --> 00:57:00.220 line:80%
Just for 30, no, 10 minutes.

00:57:00.304 --> 00:57:03.057 line:80%
It's really valuable to me,
so I have to find it.

00:57:03.140 --> 00:57:04.391 line:80%
Please.

00:57:04.475 --> 00:57:06.644 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:57:06.727 --> 00:57:07.728 line:80%
[Chan] <i>No.</i>

00:57:07.811 --> 00:57:10.064 line:80%
You're going downtown later anyway.

00:57:10.147 --> 00:57:11.815 line:80%
Just get me something I can gift.

00:57:11.899 --> 00:57:15.319 line:80%
Anything that a woman
in her twenties can use.

00:57:15.402 --> 00:57:17.655 line:80%
We're not close enough
to ask for favors like that.

00:57:18.197 --> 00:57:19.281 line:80%
Do that for me, okay?

00:57:21.742 --> 00:57:24.411 line:80%
-[door opens, closes]
-[sighs heavily]

00:57:29.917 --> 00:57:33.462 line:80%
[shopkeeper in English] Is it a gift?
I could engrave it if you'd like.

00:57:33.545 --> 00:57:34.963 line:80%
[sighs]

00:57:39.718 --> 00:57:41.178 line:80%
[footsteps approaching]

00:57:41.261 --> 00:57:42.388 line:80%
[sighs]

00:57:43.931 --> 00:57:45.057 line:80%
[Chan sighs]

00:57:45.724 --> 00:57:46.725 line:80%
Did you find it?

00:57:47.518 --> 00:57:49.019 line:80%
I'll look for it after they close.

00:57:49.520 --> 00:57:50.646 line:80%
I'm sure it'll be there.

00:57:51.271 --> 00:57:54.149 line:80%
Let's go. We can stay at SHIM
and come back to look for it.

00:57:54.233 --> 00:57:57.403 line:80%
No, this is a personal matter.
I can find it by myself.

00:57:58.028 --> 00:57:59.238 line:80%
[coughs, sniffles]

00:58:07.371 --> 00:58:09.373 line:80%
-Wear this for now.
-No…

00:58:09.456 --> 00:58:12.835 line:80%
I'm just trying to help
with your coughing, as an animator.

00:58:13.544 --> 00:58:16.380 line:80%
Plus, even if you dropped it here,
someone could have taken it.

00:58:18.465 --> 00:58:20.759 line:80%
Anyway, let's go somewhere warm--

00:58:20.843 --> 00:58:21.844 line:80%
I'll…

00:58:22.886 --> 00:58:24.388 line:80%
deal with this by myself.

00:58:26.432 --> 00:58:27.891 line:80%
Thanks for your concern,

00:58:28.642 --> 00:58:30.269 line:80%
but leaving is helping me.

00:58:31.186 --> 00:58:32.646 line:80%
[coughs, sniffles]

00:58:33.731 --> 00:58:35.524 line:80%
What are you going to do, then?

00:58:35.607 --> 00:58:37.985 line:80%
Wait out here
when you're coughing like this?

00:58:38.068 --> 00:58:39.528 line:80%
It's just some pen.

00:58:40.654 --> 00:58:42.072 line:80%
[scoffs]

00:58:42.156 --> 00:58:43.657 line:80%
You don't know anything about it.

00:58:44.575 --> 00:58:48.370 line:80%
I'm already upset
without you making it worse, so just…

00:58:49.538 --> 00:58:52.333 line:80%
[sighing]

00:58:52.958 --> 00:58:55.669 line:80%
[stutters] Where are you going?

00:58:55.753 --> 00:58:57.880 line:80%
You won't leave me alone, so I'm leaving.

00:58:57.963 --> 00:59:02.301 line:80%
It might be "just some pen,"
but I have to find it, no matter what.

00:59:02.384 --> 00:59:03.385 line:80%
[grunts]

00:59:04.386 --> 00:59:05.596 line:80%
Fine, I'll leave.

00:59:06.472 --> 00:59:08.140 line:80%
-So wear this.
-Please, just…

00:59:08.223 --> 00:59:09.224 line:80%
[Chan clears throat]

00:59:10.517 --> 00:59:11.560 line:80%
Just take it.

00:59:12.102 --> 00:59:14.104 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music continuing]

00:59:16.148 --> 00:59:17.149 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:59:43.258 --> 00:59:44.677 line:80%
"Just some pen."

00:59:45.427 --> 00:59:46.637 line:80%
[sighs]

00:59:47.262 --> 00:59:49.056 line:80%
I feel bad for saying that.

00:59:49.139 --> 00:59:50.432 line:80%
Hey, roomie.

00:59:51.558 --> 00:59:53.352 line:80%
-Yes.
-I'm sorry.

00:59:54.228 --> 00:59:56.981 line:80%
Gosh. Sorry. [chuckles]

00:59:57.064 --> 00:59:58.315 line:80%
Oh, my…

00:59:59.191 --> 01:00:01.777 line:80%
You must have gone through
something awful.

01:00:01.860 --> 01:00:04.780 line:80%
-You always seemed so cheerful.
-Oh…

01:00:05.572 --> 01:00:07.366 line:80%
[inhales sharply]
Do you want to try touching it?

01:00:07.449 --> 01:00:09.493 line:80%
[chuckles] It doesn't hurt at all now.

01:00:09.576 --> 01:00:10.577 line:80%
[scoffs]

01:00:11.078 --> 01:00:14.790 line:80%
It seems you got something drawn
on your chest.

01:00:15.499 --> 01:00:17.001 line:80%
[Chan] Ah. My tattoo?

01:00:17.084 --> 01:00:19.211 line:80%
But why is it <i>"memento mori"</i>
of all phrases?

01:00:19.294 --> 01:00:22.381 line:80%
It's like a warning to myself.

01:00:22.464 --> 01:00:24.675 line:80%
-A warning?
-Yes.

01:00:25.467 --> 01:00:28.554 line:80%
"You never know when you might die."

01:00:29.471 --> 01:00:32.891 line:80%
"So live your life without regrets."

01:00:33.392 --> 01:00:34.768 line:80%
Something like that. [chuckles]

01:00:35.728 --> 01:00:36.729 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

01:00:37.521 --> 01:00:39.231 line:80%
But what's that for?

01:00:39.315 --> 01:00:41.400 line:80%
Didn't you just pick this up somewhere?

01:00:41.483 --> 01:00:43.152 line:80%
Yes, it was snapped.

01:00:43.235 --> 01:00:44.403 line:80%
[chuckles]

01:00:44.486 --> 01:00:46.822 line:80%
Well, it grew roots.

01:00:46.905 --> 01:00:48.365 line:80%
What?

01:00:49.325 --> 01:00:50.326 line:80%
[exclaims, chuckles]

01:00:51.118 --> 01:00:53.537 line:80%
I thought it would wither soon. [exclaims]

01:00:53.620 --> 01:00:56.040 line:80%
I think it's time
to take it out of the glass.

01:00:56.915 --> 01:01:01.462 line:80%
If I move it into a pot
and take good care of it, it'll grow well.

01:01:02.421 --> 01:01:03.547 line:80%
[Manjae chuckles]

01:01:03.630 --> 01:01:05.632 line:80%
Here you go.

01:01:12.931 --> 01:01:14.725 line:80%
"Time to take it out"?

01:01:15.434 --> 01:01:17.811 line:80%
By the way, roomie.

01:01:18.604 --> 01:01:22.858 line:80%
-Yes?
-So, are you living without any regrets?

01:01:25.527 --> 01:01:27.821 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song playing]

01:01:30.741 --> 01:01:33.786 line:80%
Why would you do that?
If something happened to you…

01:01:33.869 --> 01:01:37.373 line:80%
[Yujeong] Gosh.
You suddenly cut all contact with us.

01:01:37.456 --> 01:01:40.292 line:80%
Sorry, Yujeong. I'm in a hurry right now.

01:01:41.293 --> 01:01:43.170 line:80%
It's really valuable to me,
so I have to find it.

01:01:43.253 --> 01:01:46.131 line:80%
It might be "just some pen,"
but I have to find it.

01:01:48.967 --> 01:01:51.595 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>I think it's time</i>
<i>to take it out of the glass.</i>

01:01:51.679 --> 01:01:53.722 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song continuing]

01:01:54.807 --> 01:01:55.808 line:80%
[sighs]

01:01:58.686 --> 01:01:59.728 line:80%
[door opens]

01:02:01.188 --> 01:02:02.815 line:80%
[♪ sentimental song continues]

01:02:05.150 --> 01:02:07.027 line:80%
-[cell phone beeps, dialing]
-[Haran] <i>Chan, do you remember</i>

01:02:07.736 --> 01:02:10.823 line:80%
<i>how I said I felt like</i>
<i>I was surrounded by walls?</i>

01:02:11.407 --> 01:02:13.409 line:80%
[vibrating]

01:02:17.955 --> 01:02:21.917 line:80%
<i>I suddenly found myself</i>
<i>unable to sketch anything,</i>

01:02:22.001 --> 01:02:23.794 line:80%
<i>and I had no energy.</i>

01:02:23.877 --> 01:02:25.713 line:80%
<i>I just wanted to give up on everything.</i>

01:02:26.964 --> 01:02:28.841 line:80%
[Chan panting]

01:02:33.303 --> 01:02:37.016 line:80%
[Haran] <i>But when I first held the pen</i>
<i>you gave to me for my birthday,</i>

01:02:37.099 --> 01:02:39.643 line:80%
<i>I was suddenly able to draw something.</i>

01:02:40.477 --> 01:02:42.730 line:80%
<i>And I won first place</i>
<i>in the contest with it.</i>

01:02:44.064 --> 01:02:46.900 line:80%
<i>I would have run away</i>
<i>if I hadn't gotten such great results.</i>

01:02:46.984 --> 01:02:48.319 line:80%
Excuse me.

01:02:48.402 --> 01:02:50.362 line:80%
[Haran] <i>So you saved me.</i>

01:02:51.572 --> 01:02:54.033 line:80%
<i>Thanks to you and this pen,</i>

01:02:54.116 --> 01:02:56.577 line:80%
<i>I realized how much I love my job.</i>

01:02:57.661 --> 01:03:00.122 line:80%
<i>It's a really precious pen to me.</i>

01:03:00.205 --> 01:03:02.249 line:80%
-"Haran" is engraved on the lid.
<i>-Thank you.</i>

01:03:02.333 --> 01:03:06.295 line:80%
<i>I'll draw lots of amazing clothes</i>
<i>and become a great designer.</i>

01:03:06.378 --> 01:03:08.714 line:80%
-[staff] Excuse me.
-[sighs]

01:03:09.590 --> 01:03:11.759 line:80%
I'm sorry, but we have to go home now.

01:03:11.842 --> 01:03:13.677 line:80%
[sighs] Right. I'm sorry.

01:03:13.761 --> 01:03:17.806 line:80%
If you ever find it,
can you contact me through this number?

01:03:22.311 --> 01:03:26.607 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>So, are you living</i>
<i>without any regrets?</i>

01:03:28.192 --> 01:03:29.360 line:80%
[Chan] <i>No.</i>

01:03:29.443 --> 01:03:31.695 line:80%
<i>I think I'll have a lot of regrets later.</i>

01:03:32.529 --> 01:03:35.157 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>Then what should you do</i>
<i>to not have regrets?</i>

01:03:36.200 --> 01:03:39.078 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I want someone</i>
<i>to have joy in their life.</i>

01:03:39.828 --> 01:03:41.997 line:80%
<i>Instead of their bleak life now,</i>

01:03:42.081 --> 01:03:45.417 line:80%
<i>I want it to be vibrant, like before.</i>

01:03:45.501 --> 01:03:48.003 line:80%
<i>I lived like that thanks to her.</i>

01:03:48.796 --> 01:03:51.173 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>Then you can give her that joy.</i>

01:03:51.256 --> 01:03:55.594 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'd love to,</i>
<i>but I'm not sure if I have the right.</i>

01:03:56.095 --> 01:04:01.016 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>I don't think you need rights</i>
<i>to want someone to be happy,</i>

01:04:01.767 --> 01:04:05.020 line:80%
<i>as long as you're sincere about it.</i>

01:04:05.104 --> 01:04:08.399 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

01:04:14.154 --> 01:04:16.448 line:80%
-Hello? Did you find--
-[Chan] <i>You're still there, right?</i>

01:04:16.532 --> 01:04:18.701 line:80%
Are you there?
I have something to tell you.

01:04:18.784 --> 01:04:20.285 line:80%
No, I'm…

01:04:20.369 --> 01:04:23.038 line:80%
[Chan panting]

01:04:25.624 --> 01:04:27.418 line:80%
I guess you haven't found it yet.

01:04:28.043 --> 01:04:29.294 line:80%
Well…

01:04:29.378 --> 01:04:31.547 line:80%
I'm sorry. I was rude earlier.

01:04:33.841 --> 01:04:35.300 line:80%
Hang on…

01:04:35.384 --> 01:04:37.219 line:80%
[panting]

01:04:37.302 --> 01:04:38.303 line:80%
[exclaims]

01:04:40.681 --> 01:04:43.600 line:80%
"Let's live so I won't have any regrets
when they close my coffin."

01:04:43.684 --> 01:04:47.146 line:80%
That's my life motto.
But I thought I'd have regrets.

01:04:47.813 --> 01:04:50.274 line:80%
That's why I came here.
I didn't want that to happen.

01:04:52.609 --> 01:04:56.572 line:80%
I return to the US in three months,
and I probably won't come back to Korea.

01:04:56.655 --> 01:04:57.990 line:80%
Why are you telling me this?

01:04:58.073 --> 01:05:00.951 line:80%
I want to meddle in each other's affairs,
feel indebted,

01:05:01.035 --> 01:05:03.746 line:80%
and have fun together with you, Ms. Song.

01:05:05.331 --> 01:05:06.665 line:80%
What are you saying?

01:05:06.749 --> 01:05:09.084 line:80%
Let's not think about the past or future.

01:05:09.793 --> 01:05:11.086 line:80%
Let's just have fun

01:05:11.837 --> 01:05:13.339 line:80%
until I head back.

01:05:13.422 --> 01:05:15.799 line:80%
Just until next spring.

01:05:16.633 --> 01:05:18.761 line:80%
Let's have fun like we're on a picnic.

01:05:18.844 --> 01:05:20.846 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

01:05:22.890 --> 01:05:25.726 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>But I'm really curious.</i>

01:05:26.310 --> 01:05:30.314 line:80%
<i>Who is this person you want to be happy?</i>

01:05:42.117 --> 01:05:43.327 line:80%
[laptop pings]

01:05:44.620 --> 01:05:46.413 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[laptop pings]

01:05:49.625 --> 01:05:51.585 line:80%
[pinging continues]

01:05:51.669 --> 01:05:53.712 line:80%
[pinging rapidly]

01:05:54.630 --> 01:05:56.298 line:80%
[groaning]

01:05:56.382 --> 01:05:57.966 line:80%
<i>-I was trying to die…</i>
-[groans]

01:05:58.550 --> 01:06:00.636 line:80%
[EKG beeping]

01:06:01.220 --> 01:06:02.763 line:80%
<i>And I almost died.</i>

01:06:03.973 --> 01:06:06.392 line:80%
<i>But she brought me back twice.</i>

01:06:08.185 --> 01:06:09.895 line:80%
<i>A grateful disruption</i>

01:06:10.896 --> 01:06:12.523 line:80%
<i>that made me live again.</i>

01:06:15.609 --> 01:06:19.488 line:80%
Is it okay if I start being
really nice to you from now on?

01:06:20.364 --> 01:06:22.533 line:80%
[♪ upbeat love song playing]

01:06:33.836 --> 01:06:35.587 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:06:59.695 --> 01:07:02.239 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I don't think</i>
<i>we'll ever be friends.</i>

01:07:02.323 --> 01:07:05.326 line:20%
[Nana] <i>Someone who's "talking" to a guy</i>
<i>is home at this hour?</i>

01:07:05.409 --> 01:07:08.746 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I can't even go to the cafe</i>
<i>I love the most because of you!</i>

01:07:08.829 --> 01:07:11.165 line:20%
<i>I don't need any new variables.</i>

01:07:11.248 --> 01:07:15.711 line:20%
[Manjae] <i>A lot of them</i>
<i>just wither and die.</i>

01:07:15.794 --> 01:07:20.382 line:20%
[Chan] <i>I'll move out</i>
<i>so we don't have to see each other again.</i>

01:07:20.466 --> 01:07:24.678 line:20%
<i>I'll be gone</i>
<i>once our contract is over in three months.</i>

01:07:24.762 --> 01:07:25.888 line:20%
[Haran sighs]

01:07:25.971 --> 01:07:29.933 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I'd like to step away</i>
<i>from this collaboration project.</i>

01:07:33.937 --> 01:07:35.939 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

01:07:41.820 --> 01:07:42.821 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:07:42.905 --> 01:07:43.906 line:80%
